{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WAgsAGpHYA4KkbTsLu4RE5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。论文以\"DreamerV3中temporal abstraction失败的完整诊断\"为核心，claims覆盖：\n2\t  (1) 机制识别——trained dt_emb通过RSSM fidelity gap导致系统性value overestimation，因果链闭合； (2)\n3\t  定量诊断标记——nve>1.5x在Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole三环境×多seed中达到100%分类准确率（18/18）； (3) 跨环境验证——2个非Walker环境独立复现机制，collapse概率稳定在0.30-0.65区间；\n4\t  (4) 零成本缓解方案——C6（dt=1 imagination）在Walker 3-seed IQM=95% baseline，CI远离80%线， 从mitigation\n5\t  guideline升级为validated recommendation。 Discussion可cautiously扩展至其他latent-dynamics架构。CoRL审稿预期strong\n6\t  accept，R1和R6彻底解决。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: Walker Walk baseline seeds 1-2\n11\t  plan_id: plan_010\n12\t  description: 2 additional seeds for baseline v/e calibration\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    seed1_009d_eval_500K: 948\n15\t    seed1_009d_ve_105K: 0.66\n16\t    seed1_009d_ve_stable: 0.7\n17\t    seed2_009a_eval_500K: 942\n18\t    seed2_009a_ve_105K: 0.64\n19\t    seed2_009a_ve_stable: 0.69\n20\t    three_seed_IQM_500K: 947\n21\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n22\t    - 935\n23\t    - 959\n24\t    three_seed_baseline_105K_IQM: 918\n25\t  result_rationale: 'Walker Walk在DreamerV3中收敛快且稳定，seed 0已达950.9。009a@336K=919已确认收敛趋势，\n26\t    500K时将稳定在940-950区间。DreamerV3的dt=1 actor-critic在Walker上高度可重复， seed间方差受限于初始化和replay\n27\t    buffer采样的固有随机性（±1-2%）。v/e在135K+稳定在 69-72%是discount factor + bootstrapping的固有性质。三seed一致的CI宽度~24\n28\t    为后续所有normalized v/e计算提供坚实参照基线。\n29\t\n30\t    '\n31\t  tables:\n32\t  - title: Walker Walk baseline 3-seed summary\n33\t    data:\n34\t    - seed: 0\n35\t      eval_500K: 950.9\n36\t      ve_105K: 0.656\n37\t      ve_stable: 0.69-0.72\n38\t    - seed: 1\n39\t      eval_500K: 948\n40\t      ve_105K: 0.66\n41\t      ve_stable: ~0.70\n42\t    - seed: 2\n43\t      eval_500K: 942\n44\t      ve_105K: 0.64\n45\t      ve_stable: ~0.69\n46\t    - aggregate: IQM=947, CI_95=[935,959]\n47\t  figures_description:\n48\t  - 'Figure 1 baseline band: 三seed eval learning curve overlay + IQM shaded CI，展示baseline稳定性'\n49\t  - 'Figure 2 v/e calibration: 三seed v/e ratio随step演变，标注稳定区间69-72%'\n50\t  analysis: '三seed baseline一致性（CI宽度~24）为后续所有normalized v/e和vs_baseline%计算提供可靠参照。 CI不含900以下，Walker\n51\t    baseline鲁棒性确认。\n52\t\n53\t    '\n54\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n55\t  plan_id: plan_011\n56\t  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds\n57\t  expected_results:\n58\t    seed1_009e_eval_trajectory:\n59\t    - 31\n60\t    - 152\n61\t    - 160\n62\t    - 135\n63\t    - 118\n64\t    - 72\n65\t    seed1_009e_nve_35K: 1.78\n66\t    seed1_009e_nve_45K: 2.25\n67\t    seed1_009e_nve_55K: 3.85\n68\t    seed1_009e_collapse: true\n69\t    seed1_009e_collapse_onset_step: 35K\n70\t    seed2_009b_status: DONE\n71\t    seed2_009b_eval_105K: 267.93\n72\t    seed2_009b_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.62x@45K (transient)\n73\t    seed2_009b_collapse: false\n74\t    three_seed_nve_above_1_5x_at_35Kplus: 3/3\n75\t    three_seed_collapse_count: 2/3\n76\t    collapse_probability: 0.67\n77\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM reward gap 2.78x确保trained dt_emb在所有seed中产生系统性value overestimation。\n78\t    seed 0 (008d)已验证sustained nve>1.5x across 3连续checkpoints→collapse；seed 2 (009b)\n79\t    已验证transient nve>1.5x→self-correction。best档下seed 1 (009e)复现seed 0的sustained pattern：early\n80\t    training stochasticity使overestimation feedback loop在35K前锁定， nve持续加速（1.78x→2.25x→3.85x），actor被误导的policy\n81\t    gradients不可逆转。 collapse概率2/3反映bifurcation的stochastic nature（consistent with Henderson\n82\t    et al. 2018）， 而3/3 exceed 1.5x证明诊断标记的perfect sensitivity。\n83\t\n84\t    '\n85\t  tables:\n86\t  - title: Walker trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n87\t    data:\n88\t    - seed: 0\n89\t      exp: 008d\n90\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 2.09x@45K sustained\n91\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 3 consecutive\n92\t      collapse: 'YES'\n93\t      eval_final: 83@55K\n94\t    - seed: 1\n95\t      exp: 009e\n96\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 2.25x@45K sustained\n97\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 3 consecutive\n98\t      collapse: 'YES'\n99\t      eval_final: 72@55K\n100\t    - seed: 2\n101\t      exp: 009b\n102\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.62x@45K transient\n103\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 1 only\n104\t      collapse: 'NO'\n105\t      eval_final: 268@105K\n106\t  figures_description:\n107\t  - 'Figure 6扩展: 三seed nve trajectory overlay + 1.5x threshold line，sustained vs transient区间标注'\n108\t  - 'Collapse bifurcation diagram: sustained nve>1.5x path vs self-correction path'\n109\t  analysis: '3/3 exceed nve>1.5x（perfect sensitivity）、2/3 collapse（stochastic consequence）。\n110\t    核心论述成立：trained dt_emb是nve>1.5x的reliable trigger（100%），collapse是stochastic but\n111\t    real risk（67%）。结合untrained seeds 0/3 exceed 1.5x，Walker separating power = 6/6。\n112\t\n113\t    '\n114\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n115\t  plan_id: plan_012\n116\t  description: Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\n117\t  expected_results:\n118\t    seed1_009f_eval_105K: 430\n119\t    seed1_009f_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.08\n120\t    seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.45\n121\t    seed1_009f_collapse: false\n122\t    seed1_009f_pattern: zigzag recovery\n123\t    seed2_009c_status: DONE\n124\t    seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n125\t    seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n126\t    seed2_009c_200K_extension_nve: 1.28\n127\t    seed2_009c_200K_extension_eval: 195\n128\t    three_seed_nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n129\t    walker_untrained_classification: 0/3 exceed 1.5x\n130\t  result_rationale: 'dt_embed_dim=0移除critic利用dt信息的能力（reward gap仅1.01x），阻断value overestimation\n131\t    反馈回路。009f在best档下复现008f seed 0的zigzag recovery（nve peaks 1.08x then decline）， 因为没有dt_emb\n132\t    conditioning，value function缺乏系统性高估的机制基础。009c虽eval下降且 nve@105K=1.14x（上升趋势），但延伸至200K后nve仅达1.28x——overestimation增长速率比\n133\t    008d慢约7x（008c vs 008d数据），远不足以在合理训练时间内达到1.5x。 0/3 seeds exceed 1.5x维持与trained seeds的完美分离。性能方差大（148-503）是预期结果：\n134\t    reward prediction退化75x导致学习信号噪声大，但不影响因果结论。\n135\t\n136\t    '\n137\t  tables:\n138\t  - title: Walker no dt_emb (008f) 3-seed comparison\n139\t    data:\n140\t    - seed: 0\n141\t      exp: 008f\n142\t      eval_105K: 503\n143\t      nve_peak: 1.02x\n144\t      nve_105K: 0.3\n145\t      pattern: zigzag recovery\n146\t    - seed: 1\n147\t      exp: 009f\n148\t      eval_105K: 430\n149\t      nve_peak: 1.08x\n150\t      nve_105K: 0.45\n151\t      pattern: zigzag recovery\n152\t    - seed: 2\n153\t      exp: 009c\n154\t      eval_105K: 148\n155\t      nve_peak: 1.26x\n156\t      nve_105K: 1.14\n157\t      pattern: decline after 75K\n158\t  figures_description:\n159\t  - 'Figure 6对比panel: 008f三seed nve（全<1.5x）vs 008d三seed nve（全>1.5x），视觉化separating\n160\t    power'\n161\t  analysis: '因果控制方向确认：去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x。008f是因果控制实验（证明方向）， 不是推荐方案（性能方差大、reward退化严重）。推荐方案仍是008e_v3（C6）。\n162\t\n163\t    '\n164\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\n165\t  plan_id: plan_014\n166\t  description: Multi-seed validation of C6 mitigation\n167\t  expected_results:\n168\t    seed0_eval_105K: 869.9\n169\t    seed0_nve_105K: 0.8\n170\t    seed1_eval_105K: 858\n171\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.78\n172\t    seed1_vs_baseline: 93.5%\n173\t    seed2_eval_105K: 882\n174\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.83\n175\t    seed2_vs_baseline: 96.1%\n176\t    three_seed_IQM: 870\n177\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n178\t    - 852\n179\t    - 888\n180\t    three_seed_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n181\t    CI_lower_vs_80pct_baseline: 852 >> 732 (80% of 918)\n182\t  result_rationale: '008e_v3的dt=1 imagination是deterministic选择（gate_dt_1_frac=1.0），不受training\n183\t    stochasticity影响。无论seed如何变化，imagination rollout始终使用dt=1 transition， RSSM在dt=1的高fidelity（obs_MSE\n184\t    13.49 vs dt=2的27.50）确保value estimates准确。 seed间方差仅来自actor optimization的固有随机性（±2-3%），不涉及delusional\n185\t    critic机制。 三seed一致收敛到93-96% baseline，IQM=870的CI=[852,888]远高于80%线（732）， 彻底消除R6对C6可靠性的质疑。nve稳定在0.72-0.83x（健康范围内），确认value\n186\t    estimation 正常，无optimistic drift。\n187\t\n188\t    '\n189\t  tables:\n190\t  - title: Walker C6 mitigation (008e_v3) 3-seed summary\n191\t    data:\n192\t    - seed: 0\n193\t      eval_105K: 869.9\n194\t      nve_105K: 0.8\n195\t      vs_baseline: 95.0%\n196\t    - seed: 1\n197\t      eval_105K: 858\n198\t      nve_105K: 0.78\n199\t      vs_baseline: 93.5%\n200\t    - seed: 2\n201\t      eval_105K: 882\n202\t      nve_105K: 0.83\n203\t      vs_baseline: 96.1%\n204\t    - aggregate: IQM=870, CI_95=[852,888], pct_baseline=94.8%\n205\t  figures_description:\n206\t  - 'Figure 1 hero: 008e_v3三seed learning curves叠加baseline CI band，展示一致recovery'\n207\t  - 'Bar chart: baseline IQM vs 008e_v3 IQM + CI bars，80% threshold line标注'\n208\t  analysis: 'C6从single-seed observation升级为multi-seed validated recommendation。94.8%\n209\t    baseline + tight CI使论文自信声称dt=1 imagination是practical zero-cost mitigation。 与008d（collapse）和008f（因果控制但不推荐）的三方对比完成diagnosis-to-mitigation\n210\t    narrative。\n211\t\n212\t    '\n213\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n214\t  plan_id: plan_013\n215\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\n216\t  expected_results:\n217\t    seed1_eval_105K: 725\n218\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.62\n219\t    seed1_pattern: V-recovery with zigzag\n220\t    seed2_eval_105K: 695\n221\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.67\n222\t    seed2_pattern: V-recovery\n223\t    three_seed_IQM_105K: 733\n224\t    three_seed_vs_baseline: 80%\n225\t    nve_range_105K:\n226\t    - 0.59\n227\t    - 0.67\n228\t  result_rationale: 'untrained dt_emb的value growth suppression是structural的（seed 0在55K-105K持续nve<1.0x且\n229\t    趋势进一步diverge from baseline）。新seeds复现同样pattern：untrained embedding阻断critic 对dt信息的exploitation，value被结构性压低。V-recovery的zigzag反映actor在被压低的value\n230\t    landscape中exploration效率受限，但最终趋势向上。seed间方差（695-778）来自V-recovery timing的stochastic差异。IQM=733（80%\n231\t    baseline）优于008f但低于008e_v3，论文中定位为 \"C3 mechanism understanding\"而非推荐方案。\n232\t\n233\t    '\n234\t  tables:\n235\t  - title: Walker untrained dt_emb (008a) 3-seed summary\n236\t    data:\n237\t    - seed: 0\n238\t      eval_105K: 778\n239\t      nve_105K: 0.59\n240\t      pattern: two V-recoveries\n241\t      vs_baseline: 85%\n242\t    - seed: 1\n243\t      eval_105K: 725\n244\t      nve_105K: 0.62\n245\t      pattern: V-recovery zigzag\n246\t      vs_baseline: 79%\n247\t    - seed: 2\n248\t      eval_105K: 695\n249\t      nve_105K: 0.67\n250\t      pattern: V-recovery\n251\t      vs_baseline: 76%\n252\t    - aggregate: IQM=733, vs_baseline=80%\n253\t  figures_description:\n254\t  - 'C3 figure: 008a三seed nve vs baseline band，展示structural suppression持续<1.0x'\n255\t  analysis: 'C3多seed验证。value growth suppression confirmed as structural property of\n256\t    untrained dt_emb。 与008e_v3对比（80% vs 95%）证明dt=1 imagination is superior to untrained\n257\t    dt_emb as mitigation。\n258\t\n259\t    '\n260\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n261\t  plan_id: plan_020\n262\t  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\n263\t  expected_results:\n264\t    seed1_eval_500K: 775\n265\t    seed2_eval_500K: 790\n266\t    seed3_eval_500K: 785\n267\t    three_seed_IQM_500K: 783\n268\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n269\t    - 770\n270\t    - 796\n271\t    ve_25K: 0.1\n272\t    ve_35K: 0.23\n273\t    ve_45K: 0.31\n274\t    ve_105K: 0.58\n275\t    ve_stable: 0.62-0.67 from 200K+\n276\t    baseline_105K_IQM: 590\n277\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run是DMC中与Walker难度相当的连续控制任务。DreamerV3原论文报告~800 at 1M steps，\n278\t    500K下达783符合sample efficiency预期。v/e calibration与Walker类似但收敛稍慢 （Cheetah velocity-based\n279\t    reward结构使value estimation需要更多training data）， asymptotic v/e略低（0.62-0.67 vs Walker\n280\t    0.69-0.72）反映reward scale和episode horizon差异。 三seed一致性高因为Cheetah dynamics相对光滑。baseline_105K_IQM=590为Cheetah\n281\t    ablation提供参照。\n282\t\n283\t    '\n284\t  tables:\n285\t  - title: Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed v/e calibration\n286\t    data:\n287\t    - step: 25K\n288\t      ve_mean: 0.1\n289\t      ve_std: 0.02\n290\t    - step: 35K\n291\t      ve_mean: 0.23\n292\t      ve_std: 0.03\n293\t    - step: 45K\n294\t      ve_mean: 0.31\n295\t      ve_std: 0.03\n296\t    - step: 105K\n297\t      ve_mean: 0.58\n298\t      ve_std: 0.03\n299\t    - converged: IQM=783, CI=[770,796]\n300\t  figures_description:\n301\t  - 'Cross-env baseline panel: Walker vs Cheetah eval + v/e parallel comparison'\n302\t  analysis: 'Cheetah baseline确立。IQM=783和v/e calibration为该环境所有ablation提供normalized\n303\t    v/e 计算的reference。\n304\t\n305\t    '\n306\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n307\t  plan_id: plan_021\n308\t  description: Replicate delusional critic mechanism in Cheetah Run\n309\t  expected_results:\n310\t    seed1_eval_peak: 310\n311\t    seed1_eval_65K: 95\n312\t    seed1_nve_35K: 1.72\n313\t    seed1_nve_45K: 2.35\n314\t    seed1_collapse: true\n315\t    seed2_eval_105K: 245\n316\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.65x@45K\n317\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.75\n318\t    seed2_collapse: false\n319\t    seed3_eval_105K: 210\n320\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.58x@35K\n321\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.88\n322\t    seed3_collapse: false\n323\t    nve_above_1_5x_count: 3/3\n324\t    collapse_count: 1/3\n325\t    cheetah_trained_classification: 3/3 exceed 1.5x\n326\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity gap是architecture-level property（autoregressive\n327\t    prediction error compounding）， 不因环境改变。Cheetah的RSSM在dt=2上同样有显著obs/reward prediction退化，trained\n328\t    dt_emb 同样使critic exploit imprecise dt>1 predictions。3/3 seeds exceed nve>1.5x与Walker一致\n329\t    （mechanism is environment-independent）。collapse概率1/3略低于Walker的2/3，因为Cheetah velocity-based\n330\t    reward更平滑，self-correction force略强——early overestimation更容易被 environment returns纠正。但1/3\n331\t    collapse仍足以证明real risk（>30% threshold）。 seed 1的early stochasticity锁定sustained\n332\t    overestimation pattern，另两seed transient exceed后self-correct。\n333\t\n334\t    '\n335\t  tables:\n336\t  - title: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n337\t    data:\n338\t    - seed: 1\n339\t      eval_peak: 310\n340\t      eval_final: 95@65K\n341\t      nve_peak: 2.35x@45K\n342\t      collapse: 'YES'\n343\t    - seed: 2\n344\t      eval_peak: 280\n345\t      eval_final: 245@105K\n346\t      nve_peak: 1.65x@45K\n347\t      collapse: 'NO'\n348\t    - seed: 3\n349\t      eval_peak: 265\n350\t      eval_final: 210@105K\n351\t      nve_peak: 1.58x@35K\n352\t      collapse: 'NO'\n353\t  figures_description:\n354\t  - 'Cross-env nve comparison: Walker vs Cheetah trained dt_emb nve trajectories并排\n355\t    + 1.5x line'\n356\t  - Cheetah three-seed eval + nve dual-axis plot\n357\t  analysis: '第一个非Walker环境验证C2。3/3 exceed nve>1.5x直接回应R1（单环境concern）。 collapse概率1/3使跨环境合并概率=(2+1)/(3+3)=50%，在[0.3,0.65]内。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n361\t  plan_id: plan_022\n362\t  description: Replicate causal control in Cheetah Run\n363\t  expected_results:\n364\t    seed1_eval_105K: 385\n365\t    seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n366\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.5\n367\t    seed2_eval_105K: 340\n368\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.18\n369\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.72\n370\t    seed3_eval_105K: 360\n371\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.12\n372\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.62\n373\t    nve_above_1_5x_count: 0/3\n374\t    cheetah_classification_accuracy: 6/6 (trained 3/3 exceed + untrained 0/3 exceed)\n375\t  result_rationale: '与Walker 008f一致：去掉dt_embedding后reward head无法区分dt=1/dt=2（reward\n376\t    gap ~1.0x）， value overestimation反馈回路被阻断。Cheetah环境不改变这一机制——RSSM prediction error\n377\t    仍存在但critic无法exploit dt信息。三seed nve peaks（1.05-1.18x）远低于1.5x threshold， 与同环境trained\n378\t    dt_emb seeds的1.58-2.35x形成clean separation。eval方差（340-385） 反映缺失dt_embedding后reward\n379\t    prediction退化的随机影响，但不影响分类结论。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t  tables:\n383\t  - title: Cheetah Run no dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n384\t    data:\n385\t    - seed: 1\n386\t      eval_105K: 385\n387\t      nve_peak: 1.05x\n388\t      nve_105K: 0.5\n389\t    - seed: 2\n390\t      eval_105K: 340\n391\t      nve_peak: 1.18x\n392\t      nve_105K: 0.72\n393\t    - seed: 3\n394\t      eval_105K: 360\n395\t      nve_peak: 1.12x\n396\t      nve_105K: 0.62\n397\t  figures_description:\n398\t  - 'Cheetah nve threshold scatter: trained seeds (>1.5x) vs untrained seeds (<1.5x)，zero\n399\t    overlap'\n400\t  analysis: 'Cheetah 6/6分类准确率。Combined Walker+Cheetah = 12/12 = 100%。 因果控制方向在第二环境独立确认。\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n404\t  plan_id: plan_023\n405\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression (C3) in Cheetah Run\n406\t  expected_results:\n407\t    seed1_eval_105K: 460\n408\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.58\n409\t    seed1_pattern: V-recovery\n410\t    seed2_eval_105K: 425\n411\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.65\n412\t    seed2_pattern: V-recovery\n413\t    seed3_eval_105K: 440\n414\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.6\n415\t    seed3_pattern: slow climb\n416\t    three_seed_IQM: 442\n417\t    vs_baseline_pct: 75%\n418\t  result_rationale: 'untrained dt_emb的value suppression机制是architecture-level的，Cheetah中同样表现为\n419\t    nve<1.0x structural suppression。Cheetah smoother reward landscape使V-recovery更稳定\n420\t    （较少zigzag），IQM=75% baseline与Walker 80%可比。no subsample保留全部training transitions，\n421\t    与plan_022（subsample ON）的对比可进一步分离subsample vs dt_emb效应（C5 support）。 三seed一致在60-75%\n422\t    baseline区间，确认value suppression的cross-env robustness。\n423\t\n424\t    '\n425\t  tables:\n426\t  - title: Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3-seed summary\n427\t    data:\n428\t    - seed: 1\n429\t      eval_105K: 460\n430\t      nve_105K: 0.58\n431\t    - seed: 2\n432\t      eval_105K: 425\n433\t      nve_105K: 0.65\n434\t    - seed: 3\n435\t      eval_105K: 440\n436\t      nve_105K: 0.6\n437\t    - aggregate: IQM=442, 75% baseline\n438\t  figures_description:\n439\t  - 'Cross-env C3: Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb nve suppression parallel\n440\t    panels'\n441\t  analysis: 'C3跨环境验证。value growth suppression confirmed as architecture-level property。\n442\t    论文C3 evidence表增加Cheetah行。\n443\t\n444\t    '\n445\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n446\t  plan_id: plan_030\n447\t  description: Systematic RSSM fidelity gap measurement across checkpoints and environments\n448\t  expected_results:\n449\t    walker_obs_gap_25K: 1.85\n450\t    walker_obs_gap_45K: 2.04\n451\t    walker_obs_gap_105K: 2.2\n452\t    walker_reward_gap_trained: 2.78\n453\t    walker_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.01\n454\t    cheetah_obs_gap_baseline: 2.1\n455\t    cheetah_reward_gap_trained: 2.55\n456\t    cheetah_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.03\n457\t    cartpole_obs_gap_baseline: 1.95\n458\t    cartpole_reward_gap_trained: 2.4\n459\t    gap_nve_pearson_r: 0.87\n460\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM autoregressive prediction的compounding error在dt>1时是数学必然——obs\n461\t    gap ~2.0x 是两步预测误差近似翻倍的直接反映。trained dt_emb使reward head学到\"dt=2应产生不同reward\" 的pattern，但RSSM\n462\t    state质量不支持这个精度，导致reward gap amplification（2.4-2.8x）。 no dt_emb时reward gap ~1.0x因为reward\n463\t    head无法区分dt。gap与nve的高相关性（r=0.87） 为因果叙事提供定量支撑：fidelity gap越大→overestimation越严重。\n464\t    跨环境obs gap一致（1.95-2.20x）证明这是architecture property。\n465\t\n466\t    '\n467\t  tables:\n468\t  - title: Cross-environment RSSM fidelity table\n469\t    data:\n470\t    - env: Walker\n471\t      config: baseline\n472\t      obs_gap: 2.04\n473\t      reward_gap: 1.56\n474\t    - env: Walker\n475\t      config: trained dt_emb\n476\t      obs_gap: 1.3\n477\t      reward_gap: 2.78\n478\t    - env: Walker\n479\t      config: no dt_emb\n480\t      obs_gap: 2.75\n481\t      reward_gap: 1.01\n482\t    - env: Cheetah\n483\t      config: baseline\n484\t      obs_gap: 2.1\n485\t      reward_gap: 1.5\n486\t    - env: Cheetah\n487\t      config: trained dt_emb\n488\t      obs_gap: 1.35\n489\t      reward_gap: 2.55\n490\t    - env: Cheetah\n491\t      config: no dt_emb\n492\t      obs_gap: 2.8\n493\t      reward_gap: 1.03\n494\t    - env: Cartpole\n495\t      config: baseline\n496\t      obs_gap: 1.95\n497\t      reward_gap: 1.45\n498\t    - env: Cartpole\n499\t      config: trained dt_emb\n500\t      obs_gap: 1.28\n501\t      reward_gap: 2.4\n502\t  figures_description:\n503\t  - 'Table 1扩展: 跨环境RSSM fidelity，绝对误差+比率并排，highlight reward gap异常'\n504\t  - 'Scatter: reward gap vs nve peak across all experiments'\n505\t  analysis: '跨环境一致的RSSM fidelity gap pattern为C2因果链提供mechanistic foundation。 论文可在Discussion中argument：任何latent-dynamics\n506\t    model若有类似fidelity gap， 都可能面临同样问题。\n507\t\n508\t    '\n509\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n510\t  plan_id: plan_031\n511\t  description: Actor entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configs\n512\t  expected_results:\n513\t    healthy_entropy_pattern: monotonic decrease 1.4→0.6 over 105K\n514\t    collapsed_entropy_pattern: decrease to ~0.5@35K then INCREASE to ~0.9@55K\n515\t    entropy_increase_magnitude: 2-3x above healthy at same step\n516\t    divergence_onset: coincides with nve crossing 1.5x (±5K steps)\n517\t  result_rationale: '健康训练中actor entropy单调下降反映policy refinement。delusional critic错误gradients\n518\t    使actor丧失learned structure，entropy回升=policy confusion。divergence onset与nve crossing\n519\t    1.5x同步因为一旦value overestimation足够严重，actor gradient被错误的value landscape主导。这提供C2的independent\n520\t    observable（除nve外的第二个collapse早期信号）。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t  tables: []\n524\t  figures_description:\n525\t  - 'Entropy divergence: healthy (008a/008c/008e_v3) vs collapsed (006/008d) entropy\n526\t    curves'\n527\t  analysis: 'Actor entropy increase与nve>1.5x的temporal coincidence提供因果链的独立证据维度。 可作为Discussion中的secondary\n528\t    diagnostic signal。\n529\t\n530\t    '\n531\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n532\t  plan_id: plan_032\n533\t  description: Distributional analysis of V(s) vs MC return\n534\t  expected_results:\n535\t    trained_dtEmb_distribution: heavy right tail, V(s) 1.5-3x above MC return\n536\t    untrained_dtEmb_distribution: slight left skew, V(s) ~0.8x MC return\n537\t    baseline_distribution: well-calibrated, ~10-20% overestimation\n538\t    kl_trained_vs_true: 0.45\n539\t    kl_untrained_vs_true: 0.12\n540\t    kl_baseline_vs_true: 0.08\n541\t  result_rationale: 'trained dt_emb使critic系统性高估dt>1 transitions的value，体现为V(s)分布的heavy\n542\t    right tail。 untrained dt_emb抑制这个机制，分布略左偏（value被压低）。KL divergence定量化overestimation\n543\t    程度（0.45 vs 0.08），比单一v/e ratio更informative——展示overestimation的distributional structure而非point\n544\t    estimate。直接回应R3。\n545\t\n546\t    '\n547\t  tables: []\n548\t  figures_description:\n549\t  - 'V(s) vs MC return scatter+histogram: 三配置对比，KL标注'\n550\t  analysis: '回应R3（v/e ratio粗糙proxy）。distributional evidence更rigorous。0 GPU成本，应包含在论文中。\n551\t\n552\t    '\n553\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n554\t  plan_id: plan_033\n555\t  description: Learned dt embedding divergence over training\n556\t  expected_results:\n557\t    cosine_sim_5K: 0.85\n558\t    cosine_sim_25K: 0.45\n559\t    cosine_sim_45K: 0.25\n560\t    cosine_sim_105K: 0.2\n561\t    divergence_onset: 15K-25K\n562\t    norm_ratio_dt2_over_dt1_105K: 1.35\n563\t  result_rationale: 'dt_embedding初始化为random（cosine ~0.85 at 5K），world model训练中学习区分dt=1/dt=2\n564\t    dynamics差异，embedding vectors diverge。divergence onset（15K-25K）与reward gap开始 amplify的时间一致：embedding\n565\t    divergence赋予reward head区分dt的能力，进而创造系统性bias。 dt=2 norm比dt=1高1.35x反映model对dt>1的重视，但RSSM\n566\t    state质量不支持这个精度。\n567\t\n568\t    '\n569\t  tables:\n570\t  - title: dt_embedding evolution\n571\t    data:\n572\t    - step: 5K\n573\t      cosine_sim: 0.85\n574\t      norm_ratio: 1.02\n575\t    - step: 25K\n576\t      cosine_sim: 0.45\n577\t      norm_ratio: 1.2\n578\t    - step: 45K\n579\t      cosine_sim: 0.25\n580\t      norm_ratio: 1.3\n581\t    - step: 105K\n582\t      cosine_sim: 0.2\n583\t      norm_ratio: 1.35\n584\t  figures_description:\n585\t  - Embedding divergence timeline + nve onset annotation\n586\t  analysis: 'embedding-level evidence: trained dt_emb确实学到区分dt的representation， 这正是trigger\n587\t    overestimation的前提。与untrained dt_emb（cosine ~0.85 throughout）对比。\n588\t\n589\t    '\n590\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n591\t  plan_id: plan_050\n592\t  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\n593\t  expected_results:\n594\t    seed1_eval_500K: 842\n595\t    seed2_eval_500K: 850\n596\t    seed3_eval_500K: 838\n597\t    three_seed_IQM: 843\n598\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n599\t    - 835\n600\t    - 851\n601\t    ve_35K: 0.25\n602\t    ve_105K: 0.56\n603\t    ve_stable: 0.60-0.65\n604\t    baseline_105K_IQM: 720\n605\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion环境拓宽scope。DreamerV3在Cartpole上表现优异\n606\t    （原论文~860 at 1M），500K下达843合理。Cartpole dynamics相对简单（4D state）， 训练方差小（CI宽度~16）。v/e收敛略低（0.60-0.65）反映shorter\n607\t    effective episode horizon。 作为非locomotion task，其inclusion直接回应\"are results specific\n608\t    to walking tasks\"的concern。\n609\t\n610\t    '\n611\t  tables:\n612\t  - title: Cartpole baseline 3-seed\n613\t    data:\n614\t    - seed: 1\n615\t      eval_500K: 842\n616\t      ve_105K: 0.55\n617\t    - seed: 2\n618\t      eval_500K: 850\n619\t      ve_105K: 0.57\n620\t    - seed: 3\n621\t      eval_500K: 838\n622\t      ve_105K: 0.56\n623\t    - aggregate: IQM=843, CI=[835,851]\n624\t  figures_description:\n625\t  - '三环境baseline panel: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole parallel eval curves'\n626\t  analysis: '非locomotion baseline建立。三环境scope增强论文generalization claim。\n627\t\n628\t    '\n629\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n630\t  plan_id: plan_051\n631\t  description: Replicate delusional critic in Cartpole Swingup\n632\t  expected_results:\n633\t    seed1_eval_65K: 125\n634\t    seed1_nve_45K: 2.1\n635\t    seed1_collapse: true\n636\t    seed2_eval_105K: 305\n637\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.55x@45K\n638\t    seed2_collapse: false\n639\t    seed3_eval_105K: 285\n640\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.52x@35K\n641\t    seed3_collapse: false\n642\t    nve_above_1_5x: 3/3\n643\t    collapse_count: 1/3\n644\t    cartpole_trained_classification: 3/3 exceed 1.5x\n645\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity gap是architecture property，不依赖环境复杂度。即使Cartpole dynamics更简单\n646\t    （4D vs Walker 24D），autoregressive dt>1 prediction error compounding仍存在。 trained\n647\t    dt_emb在Cartpole中同样trigger nve>1.5x：3/3 seeds exceed threshold。 collapse概率1/3与Cheetah一致——simpler\n648\t    dynamics使self-correction更有效，但overestimation 本身仍可靠出现。seed 2/3的borderline peaks（1.52-1.55x）加强1.5x\n649\t    threshold的 discriminative precision——even in easiest test environment，trained\n650\t    dt_emb reliably crosses。\n651\t\n652\t    '\n653\t  tables:\n654\t  - title: Cartpole trained dt_emb 3-seed\n655\t    data:\n656\t    - seed: 1\n657\t      nve_peak: 2.10x@45K\n658\t      collapse: 'YES'\n659\t    - seed: 2\n660\t      nve_peak: 1.55x@45K\n661\t      collapse: 'NO'\n662\t    - seed: 3\n663\t      nve_peak: 1.52x@35K\n664\t      collapse: 'NO'\n665\t  figures_description:\n666\t  - '三环境nve threshold figure: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole trained vs untrained，1.5x line'\n667\t  analysis: '第二个非Walker环境验证。cross_env_mechanism_replication=2（Cheetah+Cartpole）满足best档。\n668\t    Cartpole 3/3 exceed 1.5x + borderline peaks证明threshold在simpler environments仍有效。\n669\t\n670\t    '\n671\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n672\t  plan_id: plan_052\n673\t  description: Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\n674\t  expected_results:\n675\t    seed1_eval_105K: 480\n676\t    seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 0.98\n677\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.48\n678\t    seed2_eval_105K: 445\n679\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.1\n680\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.6\n681\t    seed3_eval_105K: 460\n682\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n683\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.55\n684\t    nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n685\t    cartpole_classification: 6/6\n686\t    grand_total_classification: 18/18 = 100%\n687\t  result_rationale: '去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x，与Walker/Cheetah完全一致。 Cartpole\n688\t    simpler dynamics使no dt_emb configs表现相对更好（eval 445-480，占baseline 62-67%），因为lower-dimensional\n689\t    state从noisy reward signal中学习更高效。 nve peaks（0.98-1.10x）远低于1.5x。Grand total classification\n690\t    = 18/18 = 100%。\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  tables:\n694\t  - title: Cartpole no dt_emb 3-seed\n695\t    data:\n696\t    - seed: 1\n697\t      eval_105K: 480\n698\t      nve_peak: 0.98x\n699\t    - seed: 2\n700\t      eval_105K: 445\n701\t      nve_peak: 1.10x\n702\t    - seed: 3\n703\t      eval_105K: 460\n704\t      nve_peak: 1.05x\n705\t  figures_description:\n706\t  - 'Grand classification scatter: 三环境×2组(trained/untrained)所有18个数据点，1.5x line，zero\n707\t    overlap'\n708\t  analysis: '三环境因果控制完成。18/18 classification = 100%。nve>1.5x作为诊断标记的 cross-environment\n709\t    robustness fully established。论文可自信声称\"architecture-level diagnostic\"。\n710\t\n711\t    '\n712\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\n713\t  plan_id: plan_060\n714\t  description: RSSM uncertainty-based truncation feasibility test\n715\t  expected_results:\n716\t    eval_105K: 815\n717\t    vs_baseline_pct: 89%\n718\t    vs_008e_v3_pct: 93.7%\n719\t    nve_105K: 0.75\n720\t    truncation_rate_45K: 65% of dt>1 steps truncated\n721\t    truncation_rate_105K: 40% (RSSM quality improves)\n722\t    mean_effective_dt: 1.35\n723\t    collapse: false\n724\t  result_rationale: 'uncertainty-gated truncation在imagination中监控RSSM prediction uncertainty\n725\t    （posterior/prior KL或obs reconstruction error），超threshold时truncate dt>1 steps。\n726\t    early training时RSSM质量差→aggressive truncation（65%），随质量提升truncation率降至40%。 eval=815（89%\n727\t    baseline, 94% of 008e_v3）展示feasibility——性能略低于008e_v3因为 uncertainty estimation\n728\t    noise导致部分有益dt>1 steps也被truncated。 nve=0.75x确认delusional critic被控制。关键价值：证明beyond\n729\t    \"always dt=1\"的方向可行。\n730\t\n731\t    '\n732\t  tables:\n733\t  - title: Mitigation method comparison\n734\t    data:\n735\t    - method: baseline (dt=1)\n736\t      eval: 916\n737\t      nve: 0.66\n738\t    - method: 008e_v3 (always dt=1 imag)\n739\t      eval: 870\n740\t      nve: 0.8\n741\t    - method: uncertainty-gated\n742\t      eval: 815\n743\t      nve: 0.75\n744\t    - method: 008d (no gate, collapse)\n745\t      eval: 83\n746\t      nve: 4.12x\n747\t  figures_description:\n748\t  - Pilot learning curve vs 008e_v3 vs baseline\n749\t  - 'Truncation rate over training: adaptive behavior curve'\n750\t  analysis: '达到008e_v3的94%（>90% threshold），证明uncertainty-gated approach可行。 Discussion中作为concrete\n751\t    future direction：selective dt>1 imagination as RSSM improves。\n752\t\n753\t    '\n754\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n755\t  plan_id: plan_040\n756\t  description: Third DMC environment (harder task) for generalization\n757\t  expected_results:\n758\t    baseline_IQM_500K: 305\n759\t    baseline_CI:\n760\t    - 280\n761\t    - 330\n762\t    baseline_ve_stable: 0.55-0.62\n763\t    trained_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: 2/3\n764\t    trained_dtEmb_collapse: 1/3\n765\t    trained_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 85\n766\t    no_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n767\t    no_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 155\n768\t    hopper_classification: 5/6 (83%)\n769\t    grand_total_with_hopper: 23/24 (96%)\n770\t  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop是较难环境（不稳定dynamics, 低baseline ~300），RSSM prediction质量本身更差。\n771\t    trained dt_emb仍trigger nve>1.5x但2/3（非3/3），因为one seed在极低baseline下 v/e ratio denominator波动大（eval\n772\t    ~50-80），诊断标记noise增加使one seed的nve peak 停在1.42x（刚below 1.5x）。classification 5/6=83%略低于其他环境100%但仍robust。\n773\t    跨四环境grand total = 23/24 = 96%进一步增强generalization。\n774\t\n775\t    '\n776\t  tables:\n777\t  - title: Hopper 3-config summary\n778\t    data:\n779\t    - config: baseline\n780\t      IQM: 305\n781\t    - config: trained dt_emb\n782\t      IQM: 85\n783\t      nve_exceed: 2/3\n784\t      collapse: 1/3\n785\t    - config: no dt_emb\n786\t      IQM: 155\n787\t      nve_exceed: 0/3\n788\t  figures_description:\n789\t  - '四环境mechanism replication grid: 2×4 (trained/untrained × 4 envs), nve peaks annotated'\n790\t  analysis: 'P2 stretch goal。Hopper inclusion使scope从3到4环境。5/6 classification + mechanism\n791\t    replication增强generalization。即使不含Hopper，Walker+Cheetah+Cartpole已足够（18/18）。\n792\t\n793\t    '\n794\t- name: Best-tier aggregate metrics\n795\t  plan_id: aggregate\n796\t  description: Cross-experiment key metrics summary\n797\t  expected_results:\n798\t    C6_recovery_pct_of_baseline: 94.8\n799\t    nve_threshold_classification_accuracy: 1.0\n800\t    cross_env_mechanism_replication: 2\n801\t    collapse_prob_trained_dt_emb: 0.44\n802\t    walker_008e_v3_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n803\t    walker_nve_separating_power: 1.0\n804\t    total_remaining_GPU_hours: ~160\n805\t  result_rationale: '六项关键指标均在best档定义范围内：C6_recovery 94.8%∈[90,98]；classification 1.0∈[0.85,1.0]；\n806\t    cross_env 2∈[2,3]；collapse_prob 0.44∈[0.3,0.65]（Walker 2/3 + Cheetah 1/3 + Cartpole\n807\t    1/3 = 4/9）； IQM 94.8%∈[88,96]；separating_power 1.0∈[0.9,1.0]。narrative完整闭合： mechanism\n808\t    identification → quantitative diagnostic → cross-env validation → zero-cost mitigation\n809\t    → future direction。所有CoRL reviewer concerns（R1-R8）均有充分回应。\n810\t\n811\t    '\n812\t  tables:\n813\t  - title: Key metrics vs best-tier targets\n814\t    data:\n815\t    - metric: C6 recovery\n816\t      value: 94.8\n817\t      range: '[90,98]'\n818\t      status: ✓\n819\t    - metric: nve classification\n820\t      value: 1.0\n821\t      range: '[0.85,1.0]'\n822\t      status: ✓\n823\t    - metric: cross-env replication\n824\t      value: 2\n825\t      range: '[2,3]'\n826\t      status: ✓\n827\t    - metric: collapse probability\n828\t      value: 0.44\n829\t      range: '[0.3,0.65]'\n830\t      status: ✓\n831\t    - metric: 008e_v3 IQM %baseline\n832\t      value: 94.8\n833\t      range: '[88,96]'\n834\t      status: ✓\n835\t    - metric: nve separating power\n836\t      value: 1.0\n837\t      range: '[0.9,1.0]'\n838\t      status: ✓\n839\t  figures_description:\n840\t  - 'Summary figure: 六指标在target range中的位置'\n841\t  analysis: best档全面达成。论文framing从single-env diagnostic升级为cross-environment validated\n842\t    diagnostic framework。CoRL strong accept预期有充分数据支撑。\n843\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31787645-5970-4613-84a7-699e9017e33d","uuid":"28ebc0f2-e182-4a21-9098-d040e481bdc5","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:49:17.458Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T004704/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。论文以\"DreamerV3中temporal abstraction失败的完整诊断\"为核心，claims覆盖：\n  (1) 机制识别——trained dt_emb通过RSSM fidelity gap导致系统性value overestimation，因果链闭合； (2)\n  定量诊断标记——nve>1.5x在Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole三环境×多seed中达到100%分类准确率（18/18）； (3) 跨环境验证——2个非Walker环境独立复现机制，collapse概率稳定在0.30-0.65区间；\n  (4) 零成本缓解方案——C6（dt=1 imagination）在Walker 3-seed IQM=95% baseline，CI远离80%线， 从mitigation\n  guideline升级为validated recommendation。 Discussion可cautiously扩展至其他latent-dynamics架构。CoRL审稿预期strong\n  accept，R1和R6彻底解决。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Walker Walk baseline seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 2 additional seeds for baseline v/e calibration\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_009d_eval_500K: 948\n    seed1_009d_ve_105K: 0.66\n    seed1_009d_ve_stable: 0.7\n    seed2_009a_eval_500K: 942\n    seed2_009a_ve_105K: 0.64\n    seed2_009a_ve_stable: 0.69\n    three_seed_IQM_500K: 947\n    three_seed_CI_95:\n    - 935\n    - 959\n    three_seed_baseline_105K_IQM: 918\n  result_rationale: 'Walker Walk在DreamerV3中收敛快且稳定，seed 0已达950.9。009a@336K=919已确认收敛趋势，\n    500K时将稳定在940-950区间。DreamerV3的dt=1 actor-critic在Walker上高度可重复， seed间方差受限于初始化和replay\n    buffer采样的固有随机性（±1-2%）。v/e在135K+稳定在 69-72%是discount factor + bootstrapping的固有性质。三seed一致的CI宽度~24\n    为后续所有normalized v/e计算提供坚实参照基线。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Walker Walk baseline 3-seed summary\n    data:\n    - seed: 0\n      eval_500K: 950.9\n      ve_105K: 0.656\n      ve_stable: 0.69-0.72\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_500K: 948\n      ve_105K: 0.66\n      ve_stable: ~0.70\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_500K: 942\n      ve_105K: 0.64\n      ve_stable: ~0.69\n    - aggregate: IQM=947, CI_95=[935,959]\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 baseline band: 三seed eval learning curve overlay + IQM shaded CI，展示baseline稳定性'\n  - 'Figure 2 v/e calibration: 三seed v/e ratio随step演变，标注稳定区间69-72%'\n  analysis: '三seed baseline一致性（CI宽度~24）为后续所有normalized v/e和vs_baseline%计算提供可靠参照。 CI不含900以下，Walker\n    baseline鲁棒性确认。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_009e_eval_trajectory:\n    - 31\n    - 152\n    - 160\n    - 135\n    - 118\n    - 72\n    seed1_009e_nve_35K: 1.78\n    seed1_009e_nve_45K: 2.25\n    seed1_009e_nve_55K: 3.85\n    seed1_009e_collapse: true\n    seed1_009e_collapse_onset_step: 35K\n    seed2_009b_status: DONE\n    seed2_009b_eval_105K: 267.93\n    seed2_009b_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.62x@45K (transient)\n    seed2_009b_collapse: false\n    three_seed_nve_above_1_5x_at_35Kplus: 3/3\n    three_seed_collapse_count: 2/3\n    collapse_probability: 0.67\n  result_rationale: 'RSSM reward gap 2.78x确保trained dt_emb在所有seed中产生系统性value overestimation。\n    seed 0 (008d)已验证sustained nve>1.5x across 3连续checkpoints→collapse；seed 2 (009b)\n    已验证transient nve>1.5x→self-correction。best档下seed 1 (009e)复现seed 0的sustained pattern：early\n    training stochasticity使overestimation feedback loop在35K前锁定， nve持续加速（1.78x→2.25x→3.85x），actor被误导的policy\n    gradients不可逆转。 collapse概率2/3反映bifurcation的stochastic nature（consistent with Henderson\n    et al. 2018）， 而3/3 exceed 1.5x证明诊断标记的perfect sensitivity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Walker trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n    data:\n    - seed: 0\n      exp: 008d\n      nve_peak_35Kplus: 2.09x@45K sustained\n      sustained_above_1_5x: 3 consecutive\n      collapse: 'YES'\n      eval_final: 83@55K\n    - seed: 1\n      exp: 009e\n      nve_peak_35Kplus: 2.25x@45K sustained\n      sustained_above_1_5x: 3 consecutive\n      collapse: 'YES'\n      eval_final: 72@55K\n    - seed: 2\n      exp: 009b\n      nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.62x@45K transient\n      sustained_above_1_5x: 1 only\n      collapse: 'NO'\n      eval_final: 268@105K\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 6扩展: 三seed nve trajectory overlay + 1.5x threshold line，sustained vs transient区间标注'\n  - 'Collapse bifurcation diagram: sustained nve>1.5x path vs self-correction path'\n  analysis: '3/3 exceed nve>1.5x（perfect sensitivity）、2/3 collapse（stochastic consequence）。\n    核心论述成立：trained dt_emb是nve>1.5x的reliable trigger（100%），collapse是stochastic but\n    real risk（67%）。结合untrained seeds 0/3 exceed 1.5x，Walker separating power = 6/6。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_009f_eval_105K: 430\n    seed1_009f_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.08\n    seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.45\n    seed1_009f_collapse: false\n    seed1_009f_pattern: zigzag recovery\n    seed2_009c_status: DONE\n    seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n    seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n    seed2_009c_200K_extension_nve: 1.28\n    seed2_009c_200K_extension_eval: 195\n    three_seed_nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n    walker_untrained_classification: 0/3 exceed 1.5x\n  result_rationale: 'dt_embed_dim=0移除critic利用dt信息的能力（reward gap仅1.01x），阻断value overestimation\n    反馈回路。009f在best档下复现008f seed 0的zigzag recovery（nve peaks 1.08x then decline）， 因为没有dt_emb\n    conditioning，value function缺乏系统性高估的机制基础。009c虽eval下降且 nve@105K=1.14x（上升趋势），但延伸至200K后nve仅达1.28x——overestimation增长速率比\n    008d慢约7x（008c vs 008d数据），远不足以在合理训练时间内达到1.5x。 0/3 seeds exceed 1.5x维持与trained seeds的完美分离。性能方差大（148-503）是预期结果：\n    reward prediction退化75x导致学习信号噪声大，但不影响因果结论。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Walker no dt_emb (008f) 3-seed comparison\n    data:\n    - seed: 0\n      exp: 008f\n      eval_105K: 503\n      nve_peak: 1.02x\n      nve_105K: 0.3\n      pattern: zigzag recovery\n    - seed: 1\n      exp: 009f\n      eval_105K: 430\n      nve_peak: 1.08x\n      nve_105K: 0.45\n      pattern: zigzag recovery\n    - seed: 2\n      exp: 009c\n      eval_105K: 148\n      nve_peak: 1.26x\n      nve_105K: 1.14\n      pattern: decline after 75K\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 6对比panel: 008f三seed nve（全<1.5x）vs 008d三seed nve（全>1.5x），视觉化separating\n    power'\n  analysis: '因果控制方向确认：去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x。008f是因果控制实验（证明方向）， 不是推荐方案（性能方差大、reward退化严重）。推荐方案仍是008e_v3（C6）。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: Multi-seed validation of C6 mitigation\n  expected_results:\n    seed0_eval_105K: 869.9\n    seed0_nve_105K: 0.8\n    seed1_eval_105K: 858\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.78\n    seed1_vs_baseline: 93.5%\n    seed2_eval_105K: 882\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.83\n    seed2_vs_baseline: 96.1%\n    three_seed_IQM: 870\n    three_seed_CI_95:\n    - 852\n    - 888\n    three_seed_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n    CI_lower_vs_80pct_baseline: 852 >> 732 (80% of 918)\n  result_rationale: '008e_v3的dt=1 imagination是deterministic选择（gate_dt_1_frac=1.0），不受training\n    stochasticity影响。无论seed如何变化，imagination rollout始终使用dt=1 transition， RSSM在dt=1的高fidelity（obs_MSE\n    13.49 vs dt=2的27.50）确保value estimates准确。 seed间方差仅来自actor optimization的固有随机性（±2-3%），不涉及delusional\n    critic机制。 三seed一致收敛到93-96% baseline，IQM=870的CI=[852,888]远高于80%线（732）， 彻底消除R6对C6可靠性的质疑。nve稳定在0.72-0.83x（健康范围内），确认value\n    estimation 正常，无optimistic drift。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Walker C6 mitigation (008e_v3) 3-seed summary\n    data:\n    - seed: 0\n      eval_105K: 869.9\n      nve_105K: 0.8\n      vs_baseline: 95.0%\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_105K: 858\n      nve_105K: 0.78\n      vs_baseline: 93.5%\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_105K: 882\n      nve_105K: 0.83\n      vs_baseline: 96.1%\n    - aggregate: IQM=870, CI_95=[852,888], pct_baseline=94.8%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 hero: 008e_v3三seed learning curves叠加baseline CI band，展示一致recovery'\n  - 'Bar chart: baseline IQM vs 008e_v3 IQM + CI bars，80% threshold line标注'\n  analysis: 'C6从single-seed observation升级为multi-seed validated recommendation。94.8%\n    baseline + tight CI使论文自信声称dt=1 imagination是practical zero-cost mitigation。 与008d（collapse）和008f（因果控制但不推荐）的三方对比完成diagnosis-to-mitigation\n    narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 725\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.62\n    seed1_pattern: V-recovery with zigzag\n    seed2_eval_105K: 695\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.67\n    seed2_pattern: V-recovery\n    three_seed_IQM_105K: 733\n    three_seed_vs_baseline: 80%\n    nve_range_105K:\n    - 0.59\n    - 0.67\n  result_rationale: 'untrained dt_emb的value growth suppression是structural的（seed 0在55K-105K持续nve<1.0x且\n    趋势进一步diverge from baseline）。新seeds复现同样pattern：untrained embedding阻断critic 对dt信息的exploitation，value被结构性压低。V-recovery的zigzag反映actor在被压低的value\n    landscape中exploration效率受限，但最终趋势向上。seed间方差（695-778）来自V-recovery timing的stochastic差异。IQM=733（80%\n    baseline）优于008f但低于008e_v3，论文中定位为 \"C3 mechanism understanding\"而非推荐方案。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Walker untrained dt_emb (008a) 3-seed summary\n    data:\n    - seed: 0\n      eval_105K: 778\n      nve_105K: 0.59\n      pattern: two V-recoveries\n      vs_baseline: 85%\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_105K: 725\n      nve_105K: 0.62\n      pattern: V-recovery zigzag\n      vs_baseline: 79%\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_105K: 695\n      nve_105K: 0.67\n      pattern: V-recovery\n      vs_baseline: 76%\n    - aggregate: IQM=733, vs_baseline=80%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'C3 figure: 008a三seed nve vs baseline band，展示structural suppression持续<1.0x'\n  analysis: 'C3多seed验证。value growth suppression confirmed as structural property of\n    untrained dt_emb。 与008e_v3对比（80% vs 95%）证明dt=1 imagination is superior to untrained\n    dt_emb as mitigation。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_500K: 775\n    seed2_eval_500K: 790\n    seed3_eval_500K: 785\n    three_seed_IQM_500K: 783\n    three_seed_CI_95:\n    - 770\n    - 796\n    ve_25K: 0.1\n    ve_35K: 0.23\n    ve_45K: 0.31\n    ve_105K: 0.58\n    ve_stable: 0.62-0.67 from 200K+\n    baseline_105K_IQM: 590\n  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run是DMC中与Walker难度相当的连续控制任务。DreamerV3原论文报告~800 at 1M steps，\n    500K下达783符合sample efficiency预期。v/e calibration与Walker类似但收敛稍慢 （Cheetah velocity-based\n    reward结构使value estimation需要更多training data）， asymptotic v/e略低（0.62-0.67 vs Walker\n    0.69-0.72）反映reward scale和episode horizon差异。 三seed一致性高因为Cheetah dynamics相对光滑。baseline_105K_IQM=590为Cheetah\n    ablation提供参照。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed v/e calibration\n    data:\n    - step: 25K\n      ve_mean: 0.1\n      ve_std: 0.02\n    - step: 35K\n      ve_mean: 0.23\n      ve_std: 0.03\n    - step: 45K\n      ve_mean: 0.31\n      ve_std: 0.03\n    - step: 105K\n      ve_mean: 0.58\n      ve_std: 0.03\n    - converged: IQM=783, CI=[770,796]\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-env baseline panel: Walker vs Cheetah eval + v/e parallel comparison'\n  analysis: 'Cheetah baseline确立。IQM=783和v/e calibration为该环境所有ablation提供normalized\n    v/e 计算的reference。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: Replicate delusional critic mechanism in Cheetah Run\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_peak: 310\n    seed1_eval_65K: 95\n    seed1_nve_35K: 1.72\n    seed1_nve_45K: 2.35\n    seed1_collapse: true\n    seed2_eval_105K: 245\n    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.65x@45K\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.75\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed3_eval_105K: 210\n    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.58x@35K\n    seed3_nve_105K: 0.88\n    seed3_collapse: false\n    nve_above_1_5x_count: 3/3\n    collapse_count: 1/3\n    cheetah_trained_classification: 3/3 exceed 1.5x\n  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity gap是architecture-level property（autoregressive\n    prediction error compounding）， 不因环境改变。Cheetah的RSSM在dt=2上同样有显著obs/reward prediction退化，trained\n    dt_emb 同样使critic exploit imprecise dt>1 predictions。3/3 seeds exceed nve>1.5x与Walker一致\n    （mechanism is environment-independent）。collapse概率1/3略低于Walker的2/3，因为Cheetah velocity-based\n    reward更平滑，self-correction force略强——early overestimation更容易被 environment returns纠正。但1/3\n    collapse仍足以证明real risk（>30% threshold）。 seed 1的early stochasticity锁定sustained\n    overestimation pattern，另两seed transient exceed后self-correct。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n    data:\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_peak: 310\n      eval_final: 95@65K\n      nve_peak: 2.35x@45K\n      collapse: 'YES'\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_peak: 280\n      eval_final: 245@105K\n      nve_peak: 1.65x@45K\n      collapse: 'NO'\n    - seed: 3\n      eval_peak: 265\n      eval_final: 210@105K\n      nve_peak: 1.58x@35K\n      collapse: 'NO'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-env nve comparison: Walker vs Cheetah trained dt_emb nve trajectories并排\n    + 1.5x line'\n  - Cheetah three-seed eval + nve dual-axis plot\n  analysis: '第一个非Walker环境验证C2。3/3 exceed nve>1.5x直接回应R1（单环境concern）。 collapse概率1/3使跨环境合并概率=(2+1)/(3+3)=50%，在[0.3,0.65]内。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: Replicate causal control in Cheetah Run\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 385\n    seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.5\n    seed2_eval_105K: 340\n    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.18\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.72\n    seed3_eval_105K: 360\n    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.12\n    seed3_nve_105K: 0.62\n    nve_above_1_5x_count: 0/3\n    cheetah_classification_accuracy: 6/6 (trained 3/3 exceed + untrained 0/3 exceed)\n  result_rationale: '与Walker 008f一致：去掉dt_embedding后reward head无法区分dt=1/dt=2（reward\n    gap ~1.0x）， value overestimation反馈回路被阻断。Cheetah环境不改变这一机制——RSSM prediction error\n    仍存在但critic无法exploit dt信息。三seed nve peaks（1.05-1.18x）远低于1.5x threshold， 与同环境trained\n    dt_emb seeds的1.58-2.35x形成clean separation。eval方差（340-385） 反映缺失dt_embedding后reward\n    prediction退化的随机影响，但不影响分类结论。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah Run no dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n    data:\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_105K: 385\n      nve_peak: 1.05x\n      nve_105K: 0.5\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_105K: 340\n      nve_peak: 1.18x\n      nve_105K: 0.72\n    - seed: 3\n      eval_105K: 360\n      nve_peak: 1.12x\n      nve_105K: 0.62\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cheetah nve threshold scatter: trained seeds (>1.5x) vs untrained seeds (<1.5x)，zero\n    overlap'\n  analysis: 'Cheetah 6/6分类准确率。Combined Walker+Cheetah = 12/12 = 100%。 因果控制方向在第二环境独立确认。\n\n    '\n- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_023\n  description: Replicate value growth suppression (C3) in Cheetah Run\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 460\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.58\n    seed1_pattern: V-recovery\n    seed2_eval_105K: 425\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.65\n    seed2_pattern: V-recovery\n    seed3_eval_105K: 440\n    seed3_nve_105K: 0.6\n    seed3_pattern: slow climb\n    three_seed_IQM: 442\n    vs_baseline_pct: 75%\n  result_rationale: 'untrained dt_emb的value suppression机制是architecture-level的，Cheetah中同样表现为\n    nve<1.0x structural suppression。Cheetah smoother reward landscape使V-recovery更稳定\n    （较少zigzag），IQM=75% baseline与Walker 80%可比。no subsample保留全部training transitions，\n    与plan_022（subsample ON）的对比可进一步分离subsample vs dt_emb效应（C5 support）。 三seed一致在60-75%\n    baseline区间，确认value suppression的cross-env robustness。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3-seed summary\n    data:\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_105K: 460\n      nve_105K: 0.58\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_105K: 425\n      nve_105K: 0.65\n    - seed: 3\n      eval_105K: 440\n      nve_105K: 0.6\n    - aggregate: IQM=442, 75% baseline\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-env C3: Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb nve suppression parallel\n    panels'\n  analysis: 'C3跨环境验证。value growth suppression confirmed as architecture-level property。\n    论文C3 evidence表增加Cheetah行。\n\n    '\n- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: Systematic RSSM fidelity gap measurement across checkpoints and environments\n  expected_results:\n    walker_obs_gap_25K: 1.85\n    walker_obs_gap_45K: 2.04\n    walker_obs_gap_105K: 2.2\n    walker_reward_gap_trained: 2.78\n    walker_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.01\n    cheetah_obs_gap_baseline: 2.1\n    cheetah_reward_gap_trained: 2.55\n    cheetah_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.03\n    cartpole_obs_gap_baseline: 1.95\n    cartpole_reward_gap_trained: 2.4\n    gap_nve_pearson_r: 0.87\n  result_rationale: 'RSSM autoregressive prediction的compounding error在dt>1时是数学必然——obs\n    gap ~2.0x 是两步预测误差近似翻倍的直接反映。trained dt_emb使reward head学到\"dt=2应产生不同reward\" 的pattern，但RSSM\n    state质量不支持这个精度，导致reward gap amplification（2.4-2.8x）。 no dt_emb时reward gap ~1.0x因为reward\n    head无法区分dt。gap与nve的高相关性（r=0.87） 为因果叙事提供定量支撑：fidelity gap越大→overestimation越严重。\n    跨环境obs gap一致（1.95-2.20x）证明这是architecture property。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-environment RSSM fidelity table\n    data:\n    - env: Walker\n      config: baseline\n      obs_gap: 2.04\n      reward_gap: 1.56\n    - env: Walker\n      config: trained dt_emb\n      obs_gap: 1.3\n      reward_gap: 2.78\n    - env: Walker\n      config: no dt_emb\n      obs_gap: 2.75\n      reward_gap: 1.01\n    - env: Cheetah\n      config: baseline\n      obs_gap: 2.1\n      reward_gap: 1.5\n    - env: Cheetah\n      config: trained dt_emb\n      obs_gap: 1.35\n      reward_gap: 2.55\n    - env: Cheetah\n      config: no dt_emb\n      obs_gap: 2.8\n      reward_gap: 1.03\n    - env: Cartpole\n      config: baseline\n      obs_gap: 1.95\n      reward_gap: 1.45\n    - env: Cartpole\n      config: trained dt_emb\n      obs_gap: 1.28\n      reward_gap: 2.4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Table 1扩展: 跨环境RSSM fidelity，绝对误差+比率并排，highlight reward gap异常'\n  - 'Scatter: reward gap vs nve peak across all experiments'\n  analysis: '跨环境一致的RSSM fidelity gap pattern为C2因果链提供mechanistic foundation。 论文可在Discussion中argument：任何latent-dynamics\n    model若有类似fidelity gap， 都可能面临同样问题。\n\n    '\n- name: Actor entropy analysis\n  plan_id: plan_031\n  description: Actor entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configs\n  expected_results:\n    healthy_entropy_pattern: monotonic decrease 1.4→0.6 over 105K\n    collapsed_entropy_pattern: decrease to ~0.5@35K then INCREASE to ~0.9@55K\n    entropy_increase_magnitude: 2-3x above healthy at same step\n    divergence_onset: coincides with nve crossing 1.5x (±5K steps)\n  result_rationale: '健康训练中actor entropy单调下降反映policy refinement。delusional critic错误gradients\n    使actor丧失learned structure，entropy回升=policy confusion。divergence onset与nve crossing\n    1.5x同步因为一旦value overestimation足够严重，actor gradient被错误的value landscape主导。这提供C2的independent\n    observable（除nve外的第二个collapse早期信号）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Entropy divergence: healthy (008a/008c/008e_v3) vs collapsed (006/008d) entropy\n    curves'\n  analysis: 'Actor entropy increase与nve>1.5x的temporal coincidence提供因果链的独立证据维度。 可作为Discussion中的secondary\n    diagnostic signal。\n\n    '\n- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n  plan_id: plan_032\n  description: Distributional analysis of V(s) vs MC return\n  expected_results:\n    trained_dtEmb_distribution: heavy right tail, V(s) 1.5-3x above MC return\n    untrained_dtEmb_distribution: slight left skew, V(s) ~0.8x MC return\n    baseline_distribution: well-calibrated, ~10-20% overestimation\n    kl_trained_vs_true: 0.45\n    kl_untrained_vs_true: 0.12\n    kl_baseline_vs_true: 0.08\n  result_rationale: 'trained dt_emb使critic系统性高估dt>1 transitions的value，体现为V(s)分布的heavy\n    right tail。 untrained dt_emb抑制这个机制，分布略左偏（value被压低）。KL divergence定量化overestimation\n    程度（0.45 vs 0.08），比单一v/e ratio更informative——展示overestimation的distributional structure而非point\n    estimate。直接回应R3。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'V(s) vs MC return scatter+histogram: 三配置对比，KL标注'\n  analysis: '回应R3（v/e ratio粗糙proxy）。distributional evidence更rigorous。0 GPU成本，应包含在论文中。\n\n    '\n- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n  plan_id: plan_033\n  description: Learned dt embedding divergence over training\n  expected_results:\n    cosine_sim_5K: 0.85\n    cosine_sim_25K: 0.45\n    cosine_sim_45K: 0.25\n    cosine_sim_105K: 0.2\n    divergence_onset: 15K-25K\n    norm_ratio_dt2_over_dt1_105K: 1.35\n  result_rationale: 'dt_embedding初始化为random（cosine ~0.85 at 5K），world model训练中学习区分dt=1/dt=2\n    dynamics差异，embedding vectors diverge。divergence onset（15K-25K）与reward gap开始 amplify的时间一致：embedding\n    divergence赋予reward head区分dt的能力，进而创造系统性bias。 dt=2 norm比dt=1高1.35x反映model对dt>1的重视，但RSSM\n    state质量不支持这个精度。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: dt_embedding evolution\n    data:\n    - step: 5K\n      cosine_sim: 0.85\n      norm_ratio: 1.02\n    - step: 25K\n      cosine_sim: 0.45\n      norm_ratio: 1.2\n    - step: 45K\n      cosine_sim: 0.25\n      norm_ratio: 1.3\n    - step: 105K\n      cosine_sim: 0.2\n      norm_ratio: 1.35\n  figures_description:\n  - Embedding divergence timeline + nve onset annotation\n  analysis: 'embedding-level evidence: trained dt_emb确实学到区分dt的representation， 这正是trigger\n    overestimation的前提。与untrained dt_emb（cosine ~0.85 throughout）对比。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_050\n  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_500K: 842\n    seed2_eval_500K: 850\n    seed3_eval_500K: 838\n    three_seed_IQM: 843\n    three_seed_CI_95:\n    - 835\n    - 851\n    ve_35K: 0.25\n    ve_105K: 0.56\n    ve_stable: 0.60-0.65\n    baseline_105K_IQM: 720\n  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion环境拓宽scope。DreamerV3在Cartpole上表现优异\n    （原论文~860 at 1M），500K下达843合理。Cartpole dynamics相对简单（4D state）， 训练方差小（CI宽度~16）。v/e收敛略低（0.60-0.65）反映shorter\n    effective episode horizon。 作为非locomotion task，其inclusion直接回应\"are results specific\n    to walking tasks\"的concern。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cartpole baseline 3-seed\n    data:\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_500K: 842\n      ve_105K: 0.55\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_500K: 850\n      ve_105K: 0.57\n    - seed: 3\n      eval_500K: 838\n      ve_105K: 0.56\n    - aggregate: IQM=843, CI=[835,851]\n  figures_description:\n  - '三环境baseline panel: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole parallel eval curves'\n  analysis: '非locomotion baseline建立。三环境scope增强论文generalization claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_051\n  description: Replicate delusional critic in Cartpole Swingup\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_65K: 125\n    seed1_nve_45K: 2.1\n    seed1_collapse: true\n    seed2_eval_105K: 305\n    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.55x@45K\n    seed2_collapse: false\n    seed3_eval_105K: 285\n    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.52x@35K\n    seed3_collapse: false\n    nve_above_1_5x: 3/3\n    collapse_count: 1/3\n    cartpole_trained_classification: 3/3 exceed 1.5x\n  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity gap是architecture property，不依赖环境复杂度。即使Cartpole dynamics更简单\n    （4D vs Walker 24D），autoregressive dt>1 prediction error compounding仍存在。 trained\n    dt_emb在Cartpole中同样trigger nve>1.5x：3/3 seeds exceed threshold。 collapse概率1/3与Cheetah一致——simpler\n    dynamics使self-correction更有效，但overestimation 本身仍可靠出现。seed 2/3的borderline peaks（1.52-1.55x）加强1.5x\n    threshold的 discriminative precision——even in easiest test environment，trained\n    dt_emb reliably crosses。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cartpole trained dt_emb 3-seed\n    data:\n    - seed: 1\n      nve_peak: 2.10x@45K\n      collapse: 'YES'\n    - seed: 2\n      nve_peak: 1.55x@45K\n      collapse: 'NO'\n    - seed: 3\n      nve_peak: 1.52x@35K\n      collapse: 'NO'\n  figures_description:\n  - '三环境nve threshold figure: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole trained vs untrained，1.5x line'\n  analysis: '第二个非Walker环境验证。cross_env_mechanism_replication=2（Cheetah+Cartpole）满足best档。\n    Cartpole 3/3 exceed 1.5x + borderline peaks证明threshold在simpler environments仍有效。\n\n    '\n- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n  plan_id: plan_052\n  description: Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\n  expected_results:\n    seed1_eval_105K: 480\n    seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 0.98\n    seed1_nve_105K: 0.48\n    seed2_eval_105K: 445\n    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.1\n    seed2_nve_105K: 0.6\n    seed3_eval_105K: 460\n    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n    seed3_nve_105K: 0.55\n    nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n    cartpole_classification: 6/6\n    grand_total_classification: 18/18 = 100%\n  result_rationale: '去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x，与Walker/Cheetah完全一致。 Cartpole\n    simpler dynamics使no dt_emb configs表现相对更好（eval 445-480，占baseline 62-67%），因为lower-dimensional\n    state从noisy reward signal中学习更高效。 nve peaks（0.98-1.10x）远低于1.5x。Grand total classification\n    = 18/18 = 100%。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cartpole no dt_emb 3-seed\n    data:\n    - seed: 1\n      eval_105K: 480\n      nve_peak: 0.98x\n    - seed: 2\n      eval_105K: 445\n      nve_peak: 1.10x\n    - seed: 3\n      eval_105K: 460\n      nve_peak: 1.05x\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grand classification scatter: 三环境×2组(trained/untrained)所有18个数据点，1.5x line，zero\n    overlap'\n  analysis: '三环境因果控制完成。18/18 classification = 100%。nve>1.5x作为诊断标记的 cross-environment\n    robustness fully established。论文可自信声称\"architecture-level diagnostic\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\n  plan_id: plan_060\n  description: RSSM uncertainty-based truncation feasibility test\n  expected_results:\n    eval_105K: 815\n    vs_baseline_pct: 89%\n    vs_008e_v3_pct: 93.7%\n    nve_105K: 0.75\n    truncation_rate_45K: 65% of dt>1 steps truncated\n    truncation_rate_105K: 40% (RSSM quality improves)\n    mean_effective_dt: 1.35\n    collapse: false\n  result_rationale: 'uncertainty-gated truncation在imagination中监控RSSM prediction uncertainty\n    （posterior/prior KL或obs reconstruction error），超threshold时truncate dt>1 steps。\n    early training时RSSM质量差→aggressive truncation（65%），随质量提升truncation率降至40%。 eval=815（89%\n    baseline, 94% of 008e_v3）展示feasibility——性能略低于008e_v3因为 uncertainty estimation\n    noise导致部分有益dt>1 steps也被truncated。 nve=0.75x确认delusional critic被控制。关键价值：证明beyond\n    \"always dt=1\"的方向可行。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Mitigation method comparison\n    data:\n    - method: baseline (dt=1)\n      eval: 916\n      nve: 0.66\n    - method: 008e_v3 (always dt=1 imag)\n      eval: 870\n      nve: 0.8\n    - method: uncertainty-gated\n      eval: 815\n      nve: 0.75\n    - method: 008d (no gate, collapse)\n      eval: 83\n      nve: 4.12x\n  figures_description:\n  - Pilot learning curve vs 008e_v3 vs baseline\n  - 'Truncation rate over training: adaptive behavior curve'\n  analysis: '达到008e_v3的94%（>90% threshold），证明uncertainty-gated approach可行。 Discussion中作为concrete\n    future direction：selective dt>1 imagination as RSSM improves。\n\n    '\n- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n  plan_id: plan_040\n  description: Third DMC environment (harder task) for generalization\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_IQM_500K: 305\n    baseline_CI:\n    - 280\n    - 330\n    baseline_ve_stable: 0.55-0.62\n    trained_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: 2/3\n    trained_dtEmb_collapse: 1/3\n    trained_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 85\n    no_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n    no_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 155\n    hopper_classification: 5/6 (83%)\n    grand_total_with_hopper: 23/24 (96%)\n  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop是较难环境（不稳定dynamics, 低baseline ~300），RSSM prediction质量本身更差。\n    trained dt_emb仍trigger nve>1.5x但2/3（非3/3），因为one seed在极低baseline下 v/e ratio denominator波动大（eval\n    ~50-80），诊断标记noise增加使one seed的nve peak 停在1.42x（刚below 1.5x）。classification 5/6=83%略低于其他环境100%但仍robust。\n    跨四环境grand total = 23/24 = 96%进一步增强generalization。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Hopper 3-config summary\n    data:\n    - config: baseline\n      IQM: 305\n    - config: trained dt_emb\n      IQM: 85\n      nve_exceed: 2/3\n      collapse: 1/3\n    - config: no dt_emb\n      IQM: 155\n      nve_exceed: 0/3\n  figures_description:\n  - '四环境mechanism replication grid: 2×4 (trained/untrained × 4 envs), nve peaks annotated'\n  analysis: 'P2 stretch goal。Hopper inclusion使scope从3到4环境。5/6 classification + mechanism\n    replication增强generalization。即使不含Hopper，Walker+Cheetah+Cartpole已足够（18/18）。\n\n    '\n- name: Best-tier aggregate metrics\n  plan_id: aggregate\n  description: Cross-experiment key metrics summary\n  expected_results:\n    C6_recovery_pct_of_baseline: 94.8\n    nve_threshold_classification_accuracy: 1.0\n    cross_env_mechanism_replication: 2\n    collapse_prob_trained_dt_emb: 0.44\n    walker_008e_v3_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n    walker_nve_separating_power: 1.0\n    total_remaining_GPU_hours: ~160\n  result_rationale: '六项关键指标均在best档定义范围内：C6_recovery 94.8%∈[90,98]；classification 1.0∈[0.85,1.0]；\n    cross_env 2∈[2,3]；collapse_prob 0.44∈[0.3,0.65]（Walker 2/3 + Cheetah 1/3 + Cartpole\n    1/3 = 4/9）； IQM 94.8%∈[88,96]；separating_power 1.0∈[0.9,1.0]。narrative完整闭合： mechanism\n    identification → quantitative diagnostic → cross-env validation → zero-cost mitigation\n    → future direction。所有CoRL reviewer concerns（R1-R8）均有充分回应。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Key metrics vs best-tier targets\n    data:\n    - metric: C6 recovery\n      value: 94.8\n      range: '[90,98]'\n      status: ✓\n    - metric: nve classification\n      value: 1.0\n      range: '[0.85,1.0]'\n      status: ✓\n    - metric: cross-env replication\n      value: 2\n      range: '[2,3]'\n      status: ✓\n    - metric: collapse probability\n      value: 0.44\n      range: '[0.3,0.65]'\n      status: ✓\n    - metric: 008e_v3 IQM %baseline\n      value: 94.8\n      range: '[88,96]'\n      status: ✓\n    - metric: nve separating power\n      value: 1.0\n      range: '[0.9,1.0]'\n      status: ✓\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Summary figure: 六指标在target range中的位置'\n  analysis: best档全面达成。论文framing从single-env diagnostic升级为cross-environment validated\n    diagnostic framework。CoRL strong accept预期有充分数据支撑。\n","numLines":843,"startLine":1,"totalLines":843}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011LB37Y11BcRhhPs7GpDGP3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've now read both the paper PDF and the review context YAML. Let me understand the full picture:\n\n**Paper Summary**: \"Why Temporal Abstraction Fails in DreamerV3: A Diagnostic Analysis of Variable-Rate Imagination\" — identifies that trained duration embeddings in DreamerV3 exploit RSSM fidelity gaps at dt>1, causing systematic value overestimation (\"delusional critic\"). The nve>1.5× diagnostic achieves 18/18 classification accuracy across 3 environments. C6 mitigation (dt=1 imagination) recovers 94.8% baseline.\n\n\nThe review context outlines expected experiments for a top-tier paper, and the submission appears to address most of them. Now I'm setting up two parallel reviewers—one focusing on methods and experimental rigor, the other on novelty and positioning relative to prior work—then running through a structured roundtable where they independently assess, share findings, identify convergences, and synthesize a final recommendation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":36525,"cache_read_input_tokens":22969,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":36525},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31787645-5970-4613-84a7-699e9017e33d","uuid":"4abd2c00-4c53-43b5-b20e-d86194d1002d"}
