{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013PCSdWow9pYJKPydDUx57b","type":"tool_result","content":"1\ttier: best\n2\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。论文以\"DreamerV3中temporal abstraction失败的完整诊断\"为核心，claims覆盖：\n3\t  (1) 机制识别——trained dt_emb通过RSSM fidelity gap导致系统性value overestimation，因果链闭合； (2)\n4\t  定量诊断标记——nve>1.5x在Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole三环境×多seed中达到100%分类准确率（18/18）； (3) 跨环境验证——2个非Walker环境独立复现机制，collapse概率稳定在0.30-0.65区间；\n5\t  (4) 零成本缓解方案——C6（dt=1 imagination）在Walker 3-seed IQM=95% baseline，CI远离80%线， 从mitigation\n6\t  guideline升级为validated recommendation。 Discussion可cautiously扩展至其他latent-dynamics架构。CoRL审稿预期strong\n7\t  accept，R1和R6彻底解决。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: Walker Walk baseline seeds 1-2\n12\t  plan_id: plan_010\n13\t  description: 2 additional seeds for baseline v/e calibration\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    seed1_009d_eval_500K: 948\n16\t    seed1_009d_ve_105K: 0.66\n17\t    seed1_009d_ve_stable: 0.7\n18\t    seed2_009a_eval_500K: 942\n19\t    seed2_009a_ve_105K: 0.64\n20\t    seed2_009a_ve_stable: 0.69\n21\t    three_seed_IQM_500K: 947\n22\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n23\t    - 935\n24\t    - 959\n25\t    three_seed_baseline_105K_IQM: 918\n26\t  result_rationale: 'Walker Walk在DreamerV3中收敛快且稳定，seed 0已达950.9。009a@336K=919已确认收敛趋势，\n27\t    500K时将稳定在940-950区间。DreamerV3的dt=1 actor-critic在Walker上高度可重复， seed间方差受限于初始化和replay\n28\t    buffer采样的固有随机性（±1-2%）。v/e在135K+稳定在 69-72%是discount factor + bootstrapping的固有性质。三seed一致的CI宽度~24\n29\t    为后续所有normalized v/e计算提供坚实参照基线。\n30\t\n31\t    '\n32\t  tables:\n33\t  - title: Walker Walk baseline 3-seed summary\n34\t    data:\n35\t    - seed: 0\n36\t      eval_500K: 950.9\n37\t      ve_105K: 0.656\n38\t      ve_stable: 0.69-0.72\n39\t    - seed: 1\n40\t      eval_500K: 948\n41\t      ve_105K: 0.66\n42\t      ve_stable: ~0.70\n43\t    - seed: 2\n44\t      eval_500K: 942\n45\t      ve_105K: 0.64\n46\t      ve_stable: ~0.69\n47\t    - aggregate: IQM=947, CI_95=[935,959]\n48\t  figures_description:\n49\t  - 'Figure 1 baseline band: 三seed eval learning curve overlay + IQM shaded CI，展示baseline稳定性'\n50\t  - 'Figure 2 v/e calibration: 三seed v/e ratio随step演变，标注稳定区间69-72%'\n51\t  analysis: '三seed baseline一致性（CI宽度~24）为后续所有normalized v/e和vs_baseline%计算提供可靠参照。 CI不含900以下，Walker\n52\t    baseline鲁棒性确认。\n53\t\n54\t    '\n55\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n56\t  plan_id: plan_011\n57\t  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds\n58\t  expected_results:\n59\t    seed1_009e_eval_trajectory:\n60\t    - 31\n61\t    - 152\n62\t    - 160\n63\t    - 135\n64\t    - 118\n65\t    - 72\n66\t    seed1_009e_nve_35K: 1.78\n67\t    seed1_009e_nve_45K: 2.25\n68\t    seed1_009e_nve_55K: 3.85\n69\t    seed1_009e_collapse: true\n70\t    seed1_009e_collapse_onset_step: 35K\n71\t    seed2_009b_status: DONE\n72\t    seed2_009b_eval_105K: 267.93\n73\t    seed2_009b_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.62x@45K (transient)\n74\t    seed2_009b_collapse: false\n75\t    three_seed_nve_above_1_5x_at_35Kplus: 3/3\n76\t    three_seed_collapse_count: 2/3\n77\t    collapse_probability: 0.67\n78\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM reward gap 2.78x确保trained dt_emb在所有seed中产生系统性value overestimation。\n79\t    seed 0 (008d)已验证sustained nve>1.5x across 3连续checkpoints→collapse；seed 2 (009b)\n80\t    已验证transient nve>1.5x→self-correction。best档下seed 1 (009e)复现seed 0的sustained pattern：early\n81\t    training stochasticity使overestimation feedback loop在35K前锁定， nve持续加速（1.78x→2.25x→3.85x），actor被误导的policy\n82\t    gradients不可逆转。 collapse概率2/3反映bifurcation的stochastic nature（consistent with Henderson\n83\t    et al. 2018）， 而3/3 exceed 1.5x证明诊断标记的perfect sensitivity。\n84\t\n85\t    '\n86\t  tables:\n87\t  - title: Walker trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n88\t    data:\n89\t    - seed: 0\n90\t      exp: 008d\n91\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 2.09x@45K sustained\n92\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 3 consecutive\n93\t      collapse: 'YES'\n94\t      eval_final: 83@55K\n95\t    - seed: 1\n96\t      exp: 009e\n97\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 2.25x@45K sustained\n98\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 3 consecutive\n99\t      collapse: 'YES'\n100\t      eval_final: 72@55K\n101\t    - seed: 2\n102\t      exp: 009b\n103\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.62x@45K transient\n104\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 1 only\n105\t      collapse: 'NO'\n106\t      eval_final: 268@105K\n107\t  figures_description:\n108\t  - 'Figure 6扩展: 三seed nve trajectory overlay + 1.5x threshold line，sustained vs transient区间标注'\n109\t  - 'Collapse bifurcation diagram: sustained nve>1.5x path vs self-correction path'\n110\t  analysis: '3/3 exceed nve>1.5x（perfect sensitivity）、2/3 collapse（stochastic consequence）。\n111\t    核心论述成立：trained dt_emb是nve>1.5x的reliable trigger（100%），collapse是stochastic but\n112\t    real risk（67%）。结合untrained seeds 0/3 exceed 1.5x，Walker separating power = 6/6。\n113\t\n114\t    '\n115\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n116\t  plan_id: plan_012\n117\t  description: Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\n118\t  expected_results:\n119\t    seed1_009f_eval_105K: 430\n120\t    seed1_009f_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.08\n121\t    seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.45\n122\t    seed1_009f_collapse: false\n123\t    seed1_009f_pattern: zigzag recovery\n124\t    seed2_009c_status: DONE\n125\t    seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n126\t    seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n127\t    seed2_009c_200K_extension_nve: 1.28\n128\t    seed2_009c_200K_extension_eval: 195\n129\t    three_seed_nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n130\t    walker_untrained_classification: 0/3 exceed 1.5x\n131\t  result_rationale: 'dt_embed_dim=0移除critic利用dt信息的能力（reward gap仅1.01x），阻断value overestimation\n132\t    反馈回路。009f在best档下复现008f seed 0的zigzag recovery（nve peaks 1.08x then decline）， 因为没有dt_emb\n133\t    conditioning，value function缺乏系统性高估的机制基础。009c虽eval下降且 nve@105K=1.14x（上升趋势），但延伸至200K后nve仅达1.28x——overestimation增长速率比\n134\t    008d慢约7x（008c vs 008d数据），远不足以在合理训练时间内达到1.5x。 0/3 seeds exceed 1.5x维持与trained seeds的完美分离。性能方差大（148-503）是预期结果：\n135\t    reward prediction退化75x导致学习信号噪声大，但不影响因果结论。\n136\t\n137\t    '\n138\t  tables:\n139\t  - title: Walker no dt_emb (008f) 3-seed comparison\n140\t    data:\n141\t    - seed: 0\n142\t      exp: 008f\n143\t      eval_105K: 503\n144\t      nve_peak: 1.02x\n145\t      nve_105K: 0.3\n146\t      pattern: zigzag recovery\n147\t    - seed: 1\n148\t      exp: 009f\n149\t      eval_105K: 430\n150\t      nve_peak: 1.08x\n151\t      nve_105K: 0.45\n152\t      pattern: zigzag recovery\n153\t    - seed: 2\n154\t      exp: 009c\n155\t      eval_105K: 148\n156\t      nve_peak: 1.26x\n157\t      nve_105K: 1.14\n158\t      pattern: decline after 75K\n159\t  figures_description:\n160\t  - 'Figure 6对比panel: 008f三seed nve（全<1.5x）vs 008d三seed nve（全>1.5x），视觉化separating\n161\t    power'\n162\t  analysis: '因果控制方向确认：去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x。008f是因果控制实验（证明方向）， 不是推荐方案（性能方差大、reward退化严重）。推荐方案仍是008e_v3（C6）。\n163\t\n164\t    '\n165\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\n166\t  plan_id: plan_014\n167\t  description: Multi-seed validation of C6 mitigation\n168\t  expected_results:\n169\t    seed0_eval_105K: 869.9\n170\t    seed0_nve_105K: 0.8\n171\t    seed1_eval_105K: 858\n172\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.78\n173\t    seed1_vs_baseline: 93.5%\n174\t    seed2_eval_105K: 882\n175\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.83\n176\t    seed2_vs_baseline: 96.1%\n177\t    three_seed_IQM: 870\n178\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n179\t    - 852\n180\t    - 888\n181\t    three_seed_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n182\t    CI_lower_vs_80pct_baseline: 852 >> 732 (80% of 918)\n183\t  result_rationale: '008e_v3的dt=1 imagination是deterministic选择（gate_dt_1_frac=1.0），不受training\n184\t    stochasticity影响。无论seed如何变化，imagination rollout始终使用dt=1 transition， RSSM在dt=1的高fidelity（obs_MSE\n185\t    13.49 vs dt=2的27.50）确保value estimates准确。 seed间方差仅来自actor optimization的固有随机性（±2-3%），不涉及delusional\n186\t    critic机制。 三seed一致收敛到93-96% baseline，IQM=870的CI=[852,888]远高于80%线（732）， 彻底消除R6对C6可靠性的质疑。nve稳定在0.72-0.83x（健康范围内），确认value\n187\t    estimation 正常，无optimistic drift。\n188\t\n189\t    '\n190\t  tables:\n191\t  - title: Walker C6 mitigation (008e_v3) 3-seed summary\n192\t    data:\n193\t    - seed: 0\n194\t      eval_105K: 869.9\n195\t      nve_105K: 0.8\n196\t      vs_baseline: 95.0%\n197\t    - seed: 1\n198\t      eval_105K: 858\n199\t      nve_105K: 0.78\n200\t      vs_baseline: 93.5%\n201\t    - seed: 2\n202\t      eval_105K: 882\n203\t      nve_105K: 0.83\n204\t      vs_baseline: 96.1%\n205\t    - aggregate: IQM=870, CI_95=[852,888], pct_baseline=94.8%\n206\t  figures_description:\n207\t  - 'Figure 1 hero: 008e_v3三seed learning curves叠加baseline CI band，展示一致recovery'\n208\t  - 'Bar chart: baseline IQM vs 008e_v3 IQM + CI bars，80% threshold line标注'\n209\t  analysis: 'C6从single-seed observation升级为multi-seed validated recommendation。94.8%\n210\t    baseline + tight CI使论文自信声称dt=1 imagination是practical zero-cost mitigation。 与008d（collapse）和008f（因果控制但不推荐）的三方对比完成diagnosis-to-mitigation\n211\t    narrative。\n212\t\n213\t    '\n214\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n215\t  plan_id: plan_013\n216\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\n217\t  expected_results:\n218\t    seed1_eval_105K: 725\n219\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.62\n220\t    seed1_pattern: V-recovery with zigzag\n221\t    seed2_eval_105K: 695\n222\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.67\n223\t    seed2_pattern: V-recovery\n224\t    three_seed_IQM_105K: 733\n225\t    three_seed_vs_baseline: 80%\n226\t    nve_range_105K:\n227\t    - 0.59\n228\t    - 0.67\n229\t  result_rationale: 'untrained dt_emb的value growth suppression是structural的（seed 0在55K-105K持续nve<1.0x且\n230\t    趋势进一步diverge from baseline）。新seeds复现同样pattern：untrained embedding阻断critic 对dt信息的exploitation，value被结构性压低。V-recovery的zigzag反映actor在被压低的value\n231\t    landscape中exploration效率受限，但最终趋势向上。seed间方差（695-778）来自V-recovery timing的stochastic差异。IQM=733（80%\n232\t    baseline）优于008f但低于008e_v3，论文中定位为 \"C3 mechanism understanding\"而非推荐方案。\n233\t\n234\t    '\n235\t  tables:\n236\t  - title: Walker untrained dt_emb (008a) 3-seed summary\n237\t    data:\n238\t    - seed: 0\n239\t      eval_105K: 778\n240\t      nve_105K: 0.59\n241\t      pattern: two V-recoveries\n242\t      vs_baseline: 85%\n243\t    - seed: 1\n244\t      eval_105K: 725\n245\t      nve_105K: 0.62\n246\t      pattern: V-recovery zigzag\n247\t      vs_baseline: 79%\n248\t    - seed: 2\n249\t      eval_105K: 695\n250\t      nve_105K: 0.67\n251\t      pattern: V-recovery\n252\t      vs_baseline: 76%\n253\t    - aggregate: IQM=733, vs_baseline=80%\n254\t  figures_description:\n255\t  - 'C3 figure: 008a三seed nve vs baseline band，展示structural suppression持续<1.0x'\n256\t  analysis: 'C3多seed验证。value growth suppression confirmed as structural property of\n257\t    untrained dt_emb。 与008e_v3对比（80% vs 95%）证明dt=1 imagination is superior to untrained\n258\t    dt_emb as mitigation。\n259\t\n260\t    '\n261\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n262\t  plan_id: plan_020\n263\t  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\n264\t  expected_results:\n265\t    seed1_eval_500K: 775\n266\t    seed2_eval_500K: 790\n267\t    seed3_eval_500K: 785\n268\t    three_seed_IQM_500K: 783\n269\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n270\t    - 770\n271\t    - 796\n272\t    ve_25K: 0.1\n273\t    ve_35K: 0.23\n274\t    ve_45K: 0.31\n275\t    ve_105K: 0.58\n276\t    ve_stable: 0.62-0.67 from 200K+\n277\t    baseline_105K_IQM: 590\n278\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run是DMC中与Walker难度相当的连续控制任务。DreamerV3原论文报告~800 at 1M steps，\n279\t    500K下达783符合sample efficiency预期。v/e calibration与Walker类似但收敛稍慢 （Cheetah velocity-based\n280\t    reward结构使value estimation需要更多training data）， asymptotic v/e略低（0.62-0.67 vs Walker\n281\t    0.69-0.72）反映reward scale和episode horizon差异。 三seed一致性高因为Cheetah dynamics相对光滑。baseline_105K_IQM=590为Cheetah\n282\t    ablation提供参照。\n283\t\n284\t    '\n285\t  tables:\n286\t  - title: Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed v/e calibration\n287\t    data:\n288\t    - step: 25K\n289\t      ve_mean: 0.1\n290\t      ve_std: 0.02\n291\t    - step: 35K\n292\t      ve_mean: 0.23\n293\t      ve_std: 0.03\n294\t    - step: 45K\n295\t      ve_mean: 0.31\n296\t      ve_std: 0.03\n297\t    - step: 105K\n298\t      ve_mean: 0.58\n299\t      ve_std: 0.03\n300\t    - converged: IQM=783, CI=[770,796]\n301\t  figures_description:\n302\t  - 'Cross-env baseline panel: Walker vs Cheetah eval + v/e parallel comparison'\n303\t  analysis: 'Cheetah baseline确立。IQM=783和v/e calibration为该环境所有ablation提供normalized\n304\t    v/e 计算的reference。\n305\t\n306\t    '\n307\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n308\t  plan_id: plan_021\n309\t  description: Replicate delusional critic mechanism in Cheetah Run\n310\t  expected_results:\n311\t    seed1_eval_peak: 310\n312\t    seed1_eval_65K: 95\n313\t    seed1_nve_35K: 1.72\n314\t    seed1_nve_45K: 2.35\n315\t    seed1_collapse: true\n316\t    seed2_eval_105K: 245\n317\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.65x@45K\n318\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.75\n319\t    seed2_collapse: false\n320\t    seed3_eval_105K: 210\n321\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.58x@35K\n322\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.88\n323\t    seed3_collapse: false\n324\t    nve_above_1_5x_count: 3/3\n325\t    collapse_count: 1/3\n326\t    cheetah_trained_classification: 3/3 exceed 1.5x\n327\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity gap是architecture-level property（autoregressive\n328\t    prediction error compounding）， 不因环境改变。Cheetah的RSSM在dt=2上同样有显著obs/reward prediction退化，trained\n329\t    dt_emb 同样使critic exploit imprecise dt>1 predictions。3/3 seeds exceed nve>1.5x与Walker一致\n330\t    （mechanism is environment-independent）。collapse概率1/3略低于Walker的2/3，因为Cheetah velocity-based\n331\t    reward更平滑，self-correction force略强——early overestimation更容易被 environment returns纠正。但1/3\n332\t    collapse仍足以证明real risk（>30% threshold）。 seed 1的early stochasticity锁定sustained\n333\t    overestimation pattern，另两seed transient exceed后self-correct。\n334\t\n335\t    '\n336\t  tables:\n337\t  - title: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n338\t    data:\n339\t    - seed: 1\n340\t      eval_peak: 310\n341\t      eval_final: 95@65K\n342\t      nve_peak: 2.35x@45K\n343\t      collapse: 'YES'\n344\t    - seed: 2\n345\t      eval_peak: 280\n346\t      eval_final: 245@105K\n347\t      nve_peak: 1.65x@45K\n348\t      collapse: 'NO'\n349\t    - seed: 3\n350\t      eval_peak: 265\n351\t      eval_final: 210@105K\n352\t      nve_peak: 1.58x@35K\n353\t      collapse: 'NO'\n354\t  figures_description:\n355\t  - 'Cross-env nve comparison: Walker vs Cheetah trained dt_emb nve trajectories并排\n356\t    + 1.5x line'\n357\t  - Cheetah three-seed eval + nve dual-axis plot\n358\t  analysis: '第一个非Walker环境验证C2。3/3 exceed nve>1.5x直接回应R1（单环境concern）。 collapse概率1/3使跨环境合并概率=(2+1)/(3+3)=50%，在[0.3,0.65]内。\n359\t\n360\t    '\n361\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n362\t  plan_id: plan_022\n363\t  description: Replicate causal control in Cheetah Run\n364\t  expected_results:\n365\t    seed1_eval_105K: 385\n366\t    seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n367\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.5\n368\t    seed2_eval_105K: 340\n369\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.18\n370\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.72\n371\t    seed3_eval_105K: 360\n372\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.12\n373\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.62\n374\t    nve_above_1_5x_count: 0/3\n375\t    cheetah_classification_accuracy: 6/6 (trained 3/3 exceed + untrained 0/3 exceed)\n376\t  result_rationale: '与Walker 008f一致：去掉dt_embedding后reward head无法区分dt=1/dt=2（reward\n377\t    gap ~1.0x）， value overestimation反馈回路被阻断。Cheetah环境不改变这一机制——RSSM prediction error\n378\t    仍存在但critic无法exploit dt信息。三seed nve peaks（1.05-1.18x）远低于1.5x threshold， 与同环境trained\n379\t    dt_emb seeds的1.58-2.35x形成clean separation。eval方差（340-385） 反映缺失dt_embedding后reward\n380\t    prediction退化的随机影响，但不影响分类结论。\n381\t\n382\t    '\n383\t  tables:\n384\t  - title: Cheetah Run no dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n385\t    data:\n386\t    - seed: 1\n387\t      eval_105K: 385\n388\t      nve_peak: 1.05x\n389\t      nve_105K: 0.5\n390\t    - seed: 2\n391\t      eval_105K: 340\n392\t      nve_peak: 1.18x\n393\t      nve_105K: 0.72\n394\t    - seed: 3\n395\t      eval_105K: 360\n396\t      nve_peak: 1.12x\n397\t      nve_105K: 0.62\n398\t  figures_description:\n399\t  - 'Cheetah nve threshold scatter: trained seeds (>1.5x) vs untrained seeds (<1.5x)，zero\n400\t    overlap'\n401\t  analysis: 'Cheetah 6/6分类准确率。Combined Walker+Cheetah = 12/12 = 100%。 因果控制方向在第二环境独立确认。\n402\t\n403\t    '\n404\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n405\t  plan_id: plan_023\n406\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression (C3) in Cheetah Run\n407\t  expected_results:\n408\t    seed1_eval_105K: 460\n409\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.58\n410\t    seed1_pattern: V-recovery\n411\t    seed2_eval_105K: 425\n412\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.65\n413\t    seed2_pattern: V-recovery\n414\t    seed3_eval_105K: 440\n415\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.6\n416\t    seed3_pattern: slow climb\n417\t    three_seed_IQM: 442\n418\t    vs_baseline_pct: 75%\n419\t  result_rationale: 'untrained dt_emb的value suppression机制是architecture-level的，Cheetah中同样表现为\n420\t    nve<1.0x structural suppression。Cheetah smoother reward landscape使V-recovery更稳定\n421\t    （较少zigzag），IQM=75% baseline与Walker 80%可比。no subsample保留全部training transitions，\n422\t    与plan_022（subsample ON）的对比可进一步分离subsample vs dt_emb效应（C5 support）。 三seed一致在60-75%\n423\t    baseline区间，确认value suppression的cross-env robustness。\n424\t\n425\t    '\n426\t  tables:\n427\t  - title: Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3-seed summary\n428\t    data:\n429\t    - seed: 1\n430\t      eval_105K: 460\n431\t      nve_105K: 0.58\n432\t    - seed: 2\n433\t      eval_105K: 425\n434\t      nve_105K: 0.65\n435\t    - seed: 3\n436\t      eval_105K: 440\n437\t      nve_105K: 0.6\n438\t    - aggregate: IQM=442, 75% baseline\n439\t  figures_description:\n440\t  - 'Cross-env C3: Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb nve suppression parallel\n441\t    panels'\n442\t  analysis: 'C3跨环境验证。value growth suppression confirmed as architecture-level property。\n443\t    论文C3 evidence表增加Cheetah行。\n444\t\n445\t    '\n446\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n447\t  plan_id: plan_030\n448\t  description: Systematic RSSM fidelity gap measurement across checkpoints and environments\n449\t  expected_results:\n450\t    walker_obs_gap_25K: 1.85\n451\t    walker_obs_gap_45K: 2.04\n452\t    walker_obs_gap_105K: 2.2\n453\t    walker_reward_gap_trained: 2.78\n454\t    walker_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.01\n455\t    cheetah_obs_gap_baseline: 2.1\n456\t    cheetah_reward_gap_trained: 2.55\n457\t    cheetah_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.03\n458\t    cartpole_obs_gap_baseline: 1.95\n459\t    cartpole_reward_gap_trained: 2.4\n460\t    gap_nve_pearson_r: 0.87\n461\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM autoregressive prediction的compounding error在dt>1时是数学必然——obs\n462\t    gap ~2.0x 是两步预测误差近似翻倍的直接反映。trained dt_emb使reward head学到\"dt=2应产生不同reward\" 的pattern，但RSSM\n463\t    state质量不支持这个精度，导致reward gap amplification（2.4-2.8x）。 no dt_emb时reward gap ~1.0x因为reward\n464\t    head无法区分dt。gap与nve的高相关性（r=0.87） 为因果叙事提供定量支撑：fidelity gap越大→overestimation越严重。\n465\t    跨环境obs gap一致（1.95-2.20x）证明这是architecture property。\n466\t\n467\t    '\n468\t  tables:\n469\t  - title: Cross-environment RSSM fidelity table\n470\t    data:\n471\t    - env: Walker\n472\t      config: baseline\n473\t      obs_gap: 2.04\n474\t      reward_gap: 1.56\n475\t    - env: Walker\n476\t      config: trained dt_emb\n477\t      obs_gap: 1.3\n478\t      reward_gap: 2.78\n479\t    - env: Walker\n480\t      config: no dt_emb\n481\t      obs_gap: 2.75\n482\t      reward_gap: 1.01\n483\t    - env: Cheetah\n484\t      config: baseline\n485\t      obs_gap: 2.1\n486\t      reward_gap: 1.5\n487\t    - env: Cheetah\n488\t      config: trained dt_emb\n489\t      obs_gap: 1.35\n490\t      reward_gap: 2.55\n491\t    - env: Cheetah\n492\t      config: no dt_emb\n493\t      obs_gap: 2.8\n494\t      reward_gap: 1.03\n495\t    - env: Cartpole\n496\t      config: baseline\n497\t      obs_gap: 1.95\n498\t      reward_gap: 1.45\n499\t    - env: Cartpole\n500\t      config: trained dt_emb\n501\t      obs_gap: 1.28\n502\t      reward_gap: 2.4\n503\t  figures_description:\n504\t  - 'Table 1扩展: 跨环境RSSM fidelity，绝对误差+比率并排，highlight reward gap异常'\n505\t  - 'Scatter: reward gap vs nve peak across all experiments'\n506\t  analysis: '跨环境一致的RSSM fidelity gap pattern为C2因果链提供mechanistic foundation。 论文可在Discussion中argument：任何latent-dynamics\n507\t    model若有类似fidelity gap， 都可能面临同样问题。\n508\t\n509\t    '\n510\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n511\t  plan_id: plan_031\n512\t  description: Actor entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configs\n513\t  expected_results:\n514\t    healthy_entropy_pattern: monotonic decrease 1.4→0.6 over 105K\n515\t    collapsed_entropy_pattern: decrease to ~0.5@35K then INCREASE to ~0.9@55K\n516\t    entropy_increase_magnitude: 2-3x above healthy at same step\n517\t    divergence_onset: coincides with nve crossing 1.5x (±5K steps)\n518\t  result_rationale: '健康训练中actor entropy单调下降反映policy refinement。delusional critic错误gradients\n519\t    使actor丧失learned structure，entropy回升=policy confusion。divergence onset与nve crossing\n520\t    1.5x同步因为一旦value overestimation足够严重，actor gradient被错误的value landscape主导。这提供C2的independent\n521\t    observable（除nve外的第二个collapse早期信号）。\n522\t\n523\t    '\n524\t  tables: []\n525\t  figures_description:\n526\t  - 'Entropy divergence: healthy (008a/008c/008e_v3) vs collapsed (006/008d) entropy\n527\t    curves'\n528\t  analysis: 'Actor entropy increase与nve>1.5x的temporal coincidence提供因果链的独立证据维度。 可作为Discussion中的secondary\n529\t    diagnostic signal。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n533\t  plan_id: plan_032\n534\t  description: Distributional analysis of V(s) vs MC return\n535\t  expected_results:\n536\t    trained_dtEmb_distribution: heavy right tail, V(s) 1.5-3x above MC return\n537\t    untrained_dtEmb_distribution: slight left skew, V(s) ~0.8x MC return\n538\t    baseline_distribution: well-calibrated, ~10-20% overestimation\n539\t    kl_trained_vs_true: 0.45\n540\t    kl_untrained_vs_true: 0.12\n541\t    kl_baseline_vs_true: 0.08\n542\t  result_rationale: 'trained dt_emb使critic系统性高估dt>1 transitions的value，体现为V(s)分布的heavy\n543\t    right tail。 untrained dt_emb抑制这个机制，分布略左偏（value被压低）。KL divergence定量化overestimation\n544\t    程度（0.45 vs 0.08），比单一v/e ratio更informative——展示overestimation的distributional structure而非point\n545\t    estimate。直接回应R3。\n546\t\n547\t    '\n548\t  tables: []\n549\t  figures_description:\n550\t  - 'V(s) vs MC return scatter+histogram: 三配置对比，KL标注'\n551\t  analysis: '回应R3（v/e ratio粗糙proxy）。distributional evidence更rigorous。0 GPU成本，应包含在论文中。\n552\t\n553\t    '\n554\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n555\t  plan_id: plan_033\n556\t  description: Learned dt embedding divergence over training\n557\t  expected_results:\n558\t    cosine_sim_5K: 0.85\n559\t    cosine_sim_25K: 0.45\n560\t    cosine_sim_45K: 0.25\n561\t    cosine_sim_105K: 0.2\n562\t    divergence_onset: 15K-25K\n563\t    norm_ratio_dt2_over_dt1_105K: 1.35\n564\t  result_rationale: 'dt_embedding初始化为random（cosine ~0.85 at 5K），world model训练中学习区分dt=1/dt=2\n565\t    dynamics差异，embedding vectors diverge。divergence onset（15K-25K）与reward gap开始 amplify的时间一致：embedding\n566\t    divergence赋予reward head区分dt的能力，进而创造系统性bias。 dt=2 norm比dt=1高1.35x反映model对dt>1的重视，但RSSM\n567\t    state质量不支持这个精度。\n568\t\n569\t    '\n570\t  tables:\n571\t  - title: dt_embedding evolution\n572\t    data:\n573\t    - step: 5K\n574\t      cosine_sim: 0.85\n575\t      norm_ratio: 1.02\n576\t    - step: 25K\n577\t      cosine_sim: 0.45\n578\t      norm_ratio: 1.2\n579\t    - step: 45K\n580\t      cosine_sim: 0.25\n581\t      norm_ratio: 1.3\n582\t    - step: 105K\n583\t      cosine_sim: 0.2\n584\t      norm_ratio: 1.35\n585\t  figures_description:\n586\t  - Embedding divergence timeline + nve onset annotation\n587\t  analysis: 'embedding-level evidence: trained dt_emb确实学到区分dt的representation， 这正是trigger\n588\t    overestimation的前提。与untrained dt_emb（cosine ~0.85 throughout）对比。\n589\t\n590\t    '\n591\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n592\t  plan_id: plan_050\n593\t  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\n594\t  expected_results:\n595\t    seed1_eval_500K: 842\n596\t    seed2_eval_500K: 850\n597\t    seed3_eval_500K: 838\n598\t    three_seed_IQM: 843\n599\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n600\t    - 835\n601\t    - 851\n602\t    ve_35K: 0.25\n603\t    ve_105K: 0.56\n604\t    ve_stable: 0.60-0.65\n605\t    baseline_105K_IQM: 720\n606\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion环境拓宽scope。DreamerV3在Cartpole上表现优异\n607\t    （原论文~860 at 1M），500K下达843合理。Cartpole dynamics相对简单（4D state）， 训练方差小（CI宽度~16）。v/e收敛略低（0.60-0.65）反映shorter\n608\t    effective episode horizon。 作为非locomotion task，其inclusion直接回应\"are results specific\n609\t    to walking tasks\"的concern。\n610\t\n611\t    '\n612\t  tables:\n613\t  - title: Cartpole baseline 3-seed\n614\t    data:\n615\t    - seed: 1\n616\t      eval_500K: 842\n617\t      ve_105K: 0.55\n618\t    - seed: 2\n619\t      eval_500K: 850\n620\t      ve_105K: 0.57\n621\t    - seed: 3\n622\t      eval_500K: 838\n623\t      ve_105K: 0.56\n624\t    - aggregate: IQM=843, CI=[835,851]\n625\t  figures_description:\n626\t  - '三环境baseline panel: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole parallel eval curves'\n627\t  analysis: '非locomotion baseline建立。三环境scope增强论文generalization claim。\n628\t\n629\t    '\n630\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n631\t  plan_id: plan_051\n632\t  description: Replicate delusional critic in Cartpole Swingup\n633\t  expected_results:\n634\t    seed1_eval_65K: 125\n635\t    seed1_nve_45K: 2.1\n636\t    seed1_collapse: true\n637\t    seed2_eval_105K: 305\n638\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.55x@45K\n639\t    seed2_collapse: false\n640\t    seed3_eval_105K: 285\n641\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.52x@35K\n642\t    seed3_collapse: false\n643\t    nve_above_1_5x: 3/3\n644\t    collapse_count: 1/3\n645\t    cartpole_trained_classification: 3/3 exceed 1.5x\n646\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity gap是architecture property，不依赖环境复杂度。即使Cartpole dynamics更简单\n647\t    （4D vs Walker 24D），autoregressive dt>1 prediction error compounding仍存在。 trained\n648\t    dt_emb在Cartpole中同样trigger nve>1.5x：3/3 seeds exceed threshold。 collapse概率1/3与Cheetah一致——simpler\n649\t    dynamics使self-correction更有效，但overestimation 本身仍可靠出现。seed 2/3的borderline peaks（1.52-1.55x）加强1.5x\n650\t    threshold的 discriminative precision——even in easiest test environment，trained\n651\t    dt_emb reliably crosses。\n652\t\n653\t    '\n654\t  tables:\n655\t  - title: Cartpole trained dt_emb 3-seed\n656\t    data:\n657\t    - seed: 1\n658\t      nve_peak: 2.10x@45K\n659\t      collapse: 'YES'\n660\t    - seed: 2\n661\t      nve_peak: 1.55x@45K\n662\t      collapse: 'NO'\n663\t    - seed: 3\n664\t      nve_peak: 1.52x@35K\n665\t      collapse: 'NO'\n666\t  figures_description:\n667\t  - '三环境nve threshold figure: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole trained vs untrained，1.5x line'\n668\t  analysis: '第二个非Walker环境验证。cross_env_mechanism_replication=2（Cheetah+Cartpole）满足best档。\n669\t    Cartpole 3/3 exceed 1.5x + borderline peaks证明threshold在simpler environments仍有效。\n670\t\n671\t    '\n672\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n673\t  plan_id: plan_052\n674\t  description: Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\n675\t  expected_results:\n676\t    seed1_eval_105K: 480\n677\t    seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 0.98\n678\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.48\n679\t    seed2_eval_105K: 445\n680\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.1\n681\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.6\n682\t    seed3_eval_105K: 460\n683\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n684\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.55\n685\t    nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n686\t    cartpole_classification: 6/6\n687\t    grand_total_classification: 18/18 = 100%\n688\t  result_rationale: '去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x，与Walker/Cheetah完全一致。 Cartpole\n689\t    simpler dynamics使no dt_emb configs表现相对更好（eval 445-480，占baseline 62-67%），因为lower-dimensional\n690\t    state从noisy reward signal中学习更高效。 nve peaks（0.98-1.10x）远低于1.5x。Grand total classification\n691\t    = 18/18 = 100%。\n692\t\n693\t    '\n694\t  tables:\n695\t  - title: Cartpole no dt_emb 3-seed\n696\t    data:\n697\t    - seed: 1\n698\t      eval_105K: 480\n699\t      nve_peak: 0.98x\n700\t    - seed: 2\n701\t      eval_105K: 445\n702\t      nve_peak: 1.10x\n703\t    - seed: 3\n704\t      eval_105K: 460\n705\t      nve_peak: 1.05x\n706\t  figures_description:\n707\t  - 'Grand classification scatter: 三环境×2组(trained/untrained)所有18个数据点，1.5x line，zero\n708\t    overlap'\n709\t  analysis: '三环境因果控制完成。18/18 classification = 100%。nve>1.5x作为诊断标记的 cross-environment\n710\t    robustness fully established。论文可自信声称\"architecture-level diagnostic\"。\n711\t\n712\t    '\n713\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\n714\t  plan_id: plan_060\n715\t  description: RSSM uncertainty-based truncation feasibility test\n716\t  expected_results:\n717\t    eval_105K: 815\n718\t    vs_baseline_pct: 89%\n719\t    vs_008e_v3_pct: 93.7%\n720\t    nve_105K: 0.75\n721\t    truncation_rate_45K: 65% of dt>1 steps truncated\n722\t    truncation_rate_105K: 40% (RSSM quality improves)\n723\t    mean_effective_dt: 1.35\n724\t    collapse: false\n725\t  result_rationale: 'uncertainty-gated truncation在imagination中监控RSSM prediction uncertainty\n726\t    （posterior/prior KL或obs reconstruction error），超threshold时truncate dt>1 steps。\n727\t    early training时RSSM质量差→aggressive truncation（65%），随质量提升truncation率降至40%。 eval=815（89%\n728\t    baseline, 94% of 008e_v3）展示feasibility——性能略低于008e_v3因为 uncertainty estimation\n729\t    noise导致部分有益dt>1 steps也被truncated。 nve=0.75x确认delusional critic被控制。关键价值：证明beyond\n730\t    \"always dt=1\"的方向可行。\n731\t\n732\t    '\n733\t  tables:\n734\t  - title: Mitigation method comparison\n735\t    data:\n736\t    - method: baseline (dt=1)\n737\t      eval: 916\n738\t      nve: 0.66\n739\t    - method: 008e_v3 (always dt=1 imag)\n740\t      eval: 870\n741\t      nve: 0.8\n742\t    - method: uncertainty-gated\n743\t      eval: 815\n744\t      nve: 0.75\n745\t    - method: 008d (no gate, collapse)\n746\t      eval: 83\n747\t      nve: 4.12x\n748\t  figures_description:\n749\t  - Pilot learning curve vs 008e_v3 vs baseline\n750\t  - 'Truncation rate over training: adaptive behavior curve'\n751\t  analysis: '达到008e_v3的94%（>90% threshold），证明uncertainty-gated approach可行。 Discussion中作为concrete\n752\t    future direction：selective dt>1 imagination as RSSM improves。\n753\t\n754\t    '\n755\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n756\t  plan_id: plan_040\n757\t  description: Third DMC environment (harder task) for generalization\n758\t  expected_results:\n759\t    baseline_IQM_500K: 305\n760\t    baseline_CI:\n761\t    - 280\n762\t    - 330\n763\t    baseline_ve_stable: 0.55-0.62\n764\t    trained_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: 2/3\n765\t    trained_dtEmb_collapse: 1/3\n766\t    trained_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 85\n767\t    no_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n768\t    no_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 155\n769\t    hopper_classification: 5/6 (83%)\n770\t    grand_total_with_hopper: 23/24 (96%)\n771\t  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop是较难环境（不稳定dynamics, 低baseline ~300），RSSM prediction质量本身更差。\n772\t    trained dt_emb仍trigger nve>1.5x但2/3（非3/3），因为one seed在极低baseline下 v/e ratio denominator波动大（eval\n773\t    ~50-80），诊断标记noise增加使one seed的nve peak 停在1.42x（刚below 1.5x）。classification 5/6=83%略低于其他环境100%但仍robust。\n774\t    跨四环境grand total = 23/24 = 96%进一步增强generalization。\n775\t\n776\t    '\n777\t  tables:\n778\t  - title: Hopper 3-config summary\n779\t    data:\n780\t    - config: baseline\n781\t      IQM: 305\n782\t    - config: trained dt_emb\n783\t      IQM: 85\n784\t      nve_exceed: 2/3\n785\t      collapse: 1/3\n786\t    - config: no dt_emb\n787\t      IQM: 155\n788\t      nve_exceed: 0/3\n789\t  figures_description:\n790\t  - '四环境mechanism replication grid: 2×4 (trained/untrained × 4 envs), nve peaks annotated'\n791\t  analysis: 'P2 stretch goal。Hopper inclusion使scope从3到4环境。5/6 classification + mechanism\n792\t    replication增强generalization。即使不含Hopper，Walker+Cheetah+Cartpole已足够（18/18）。\n793\t\n794\t    '\n795\t- name: Best-tier aggregate metrics\n796\t  plan_id: aggregate\n797\t  description: Cross-experiment key metrics summary\n798\t  expected_results:\n799\t    C6_recovery_pct_of_baseline: 94.8\n800\t    nve_threshold_classification_accuracy: 1.0\n801\t    cross_env_mechanism_replication: 2\n802\t    collapse_prob_trained_dt_emb: 0.44\n803\t    walker_008e_v3_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n804\t    walker_nve_separating_power: 1.0\n805\t    total_remaining_GPU_hours: ~160\n806\t  result_rationale: '六项关键指标均在best档定义范围内：C6_recovery 94.8%∈[90,98]；classification 1.0∈[0.85,1.0]；\n807\t    cross_env 2∈[2,3]；collapse_prob 0.44∈[0.3,0.65]（Walker 2/3 + Cheetah 1/3 + Cartpole\n808\t    1/3 = 4/9）； IQM 94.8%∈[88,96]；separating_power 1.0∈[0.9,1.0]。narrative完整闭合： mechanism\n809\t    identification → quantitative diagnostic → cross-env validation → zero-cost mitigation\n810\t    → future direction。所有CoRL reviewer concerns（R1-R8）均有充分回应。\n811\t\n812\t    '\n813\t  tables:\n814\t  - title: Key metrics vs best-tier targets\n815\t    data:\n816\t    - metric: C6 recovery\n817\t      value: 94.8\n818\t      range: '[90,98]'\n819\t      status: ✓\n820\t    - metric: nve classification\n821\t      value: 1.0\n822\t      range: '[0.85,1.0]'\n823\t      status: ✓\n824\t    - metric: cross-env replication\n825\t      value: 2\n826\t      range: '[2,3]'\n827\t      status: ✓\n828\t    - metric: collapse probability\n829\t      value: 0.44\n830\t      range: '[0.3,0.65]'\n831\t      status: ✓\n832\t    - metric: 008e_v3 IQM %baseline\n833\t      value: 94.8\n834\t      range: '[88,96]'\n835\t      status: ✓\n836\t    - metric: nve separating power\n837\t      value: 1.0\n838\t      range: '[0.9,1.0]'\n839\t      status: ✓\n840\t  figures_description:\n841\t  - 'Summary figure: 六指标在target range中的位置'\n842\t  analysis: best档全面达成。论文framing从single-env diagnostic升级为cross-environment validated\n843\t    diagnostic framework。CoRL strong accept预期有充分数据支撑。\n844\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01L4jssAZWLAQJYMSAJSFtZm","session_id":"31787645-5970-4613-84a7-699e9017e33d","uuid":"f272d9ce-eef5-4070-8804-e772b301ab6e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:50:50.129Z"}
