{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01THxynLr6fhSPE8KszBqf2C","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 34\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 01:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 方案：dreamerv3-torch + DMC Walker Walk 验证事件门控可行性\\\\n  rationale: 选择 NM512/dreamerv3-torch 作为代码基础（干净 RSSM 实现，方便修改），DMC Walker Walk 作为验证任务（DreamerV3\\\\n    标准基准，快速迭代）。MVP 只验证技术可行性（gate 不坍缩、训练收敛、有效跳步），不验证完整研究假设（长时域信用分配改善需要 ManiSkill3 等长时域任务，留到\\\\n    research 阶段）。Reviewer 主要担忧 impact(3/5) 源于评估任务时长不够长（250 步 StackPyramid 可能只显示中等收益），但这是\\\\n    research 阶段的问题，不影响 MVP 方案。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 01:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 建议：量化 MVP criterion 4 + 补充 kill criteria\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer warning 两点均合理：(1) criterion 4 原为定性描述，改为 Δt 序列自相关 > 0.15 OR 标准差\\\\n    > 0.5，可判定；(2) 补充 kill criteria：MVP GPU 上限 15h，训练发散最多重试 2 次，gate 坍缩则尝试 soft attention\\\\n    mixture fallback，15h 耗尽未过则报告用户决定 kill/pivot。Info 项（entropy 阈值宽松、Walker Walk 缺相位结构、代码基础选择）均\\\\n    acknowledged，MVP 阶段不需要额外动作。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 部署 subsample curriculum 补丁，重启 event-gated 实验 (exp_002→exp_003)\\\\n  rationale: Phase 1 (0-50K) 中 subsample_variable_dt 不应生效但生效了，导致 RSSM 训练数据与 imagination\\\\n    Δt=1 不匹配，event-gated return 仅 40% baseline。这是设计缺陷，不是超参问题。44K 步的污染权重不可恢复，需干净重跑。补丁让子采样跟随\\\\n    gate curriculum：Phase 1 纯 Δt=1，Phase 2 渐进增大，Phase 3 完整 log-uniform。损失 ~1.7h GPU\\\\n    时间（cuda:1），在 15 GPU·h MVP 预算内。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: return 40% baseline due to Phase 1 subsample mismatch\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 09:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 中期评估：3/4 标准已过（gate 有效），criterion 1 (return) 是风险点，设 150K/200K checkpoint\\\\n    评估 + pivot 方案\\\\n  rationale: 'Step 96K 数据：entropy=1.54>0.3, H_eff=35.7>18, dt_std=1.30>0.5，gate 机制功能验证通过。但\\\\n    return ratio=36.5%（需≥80%），Phase 2 进行 46K 步无恢复趋势。Reviewer 估计 criterion 1 通过概率 15-25%。Plan:\\\\n    Phase 3 稳定后（150K/200K）评估，ratio<50% 则 pivot 到 K=4 + 延长 curriculum。3/4 已过说明 gate\\\\n    机制本身有价值，return 问题可能是 K 太大或 ramp 太快的调参问题。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: gate mechanism works (3/4 criteria pass) but return degrades to 36.5%\\\\n      baseline at step 96K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 10:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: Return 崩塌根因确认：imagination dt 无约束导致 OOD。修复方案 C（logits masking + clamp），从头重跑\\\\n    exp_004\\\\n  rationale: Agent 代码审查确认 _imagine 中 gate 自由输出 dt∈{1,...,8}，而 world model 训练数据受 subsample\\\\n    curriculum 限制（gate_scale=0.5 时仅见过 dt≤4）。未训练的 dt embedding → RSSM 噪声预测 → reward\\\\n    head 垃圾输出 → actor/critic progressive poisoning → return 从 37% 崩到 10%。修复方案 C：(1)\\\\n    Gate logits masking（dt > effective_max_dt 的 logits 设 -inf）做 soft constraint，(2)\\\\n    torch.clamp 做 hard safety net。不做 checkpoint 恢复（baseline RSSM 架构不含 dt_embedding），从头干净重跑。保持\\\\n    K=8 + 原 curriculum 参数，先验证 bug fix 是否足够恢复 return，若不够再 pivot K=4。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: return catastrophically collapsed to 10% at step 105K due to unconstrained\\\\n      imagination dt\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 10:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 追加修复：_compute_target dt 索引错位 2 位，与 imagination dt clipping 并行修复后重跑 exp_004\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 _compute_target 将 dts[1:] 传入 lambda_return_variable_dt，但\\\\n    dts[t] 是 gate 在 succ_t 处为下一步转移决定的 dt，不是当前步转移 dt。正确序列应为 [init_dt=1, dts[0], ...,\\\\n    dts[H-3]]，实际是 [dts[1], dts[2], ..., dts[H-1]]，每位偏移 2。Phase 1 全 dt=1 不受影响，Phase\\\\n    2+ dt 方差越大错误越严重——完美解释 gate_scale 与 return 的负相关。此 bug 比 imagination dt 无约束更致命：即使\\\\n    imagination dt 被 clip，λ-return 索引错误仍会污染 actor/critic 训练信号。两个 bug 必须同时修复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: failed\\\\n    result: dt index misalignment in _compute_target caused progressive λ-return corruption\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 11:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 停止 Walker Walk baseline（已收敛），启动 Cheetah Run baseline 为多环境泛化铺路\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 压力测试结论：单环境（Walker Walk）即使 MVP 全 PASS 也只够 workshop paper，A 类（CoRL\\\\n    DDL 5/29）需要 4-6 个 DMC 环境 + 多 seed + ablation。Walker Walk baseline 已在 ~920 eval_return\\\\n    稳定超过 100K 步，不需要继续跑到 500K。cuda:0 应立即用于铺 Cheetah Run baseline——无论 exp_004 成功（需要多环境验证泛化）还是失败（K=4\\\\n    pivot 也需要多环境），Cheetah baseline 都是必须的。同时 Cheetah Run 是 DreamerV3 标准基准之一，episode\\\\n    结构不同于 Walker Walk，能测试 gate 在不同运动模式下的行为。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: Walker Walk baseline converged at ~920 eval_return\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 15:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: Kill exp_004：gate_loss 爆炸 bug（compute_gate_targets 用 gate_max_dt 而非 effective_max_dt），第三次\\\\n    train/imagine distribution mismatch，需全量审计后重启 exp_005\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 gate_loss 从 0 跳到 2.84e8（正常值 ~5），根因：compute_gate_targets 生成\\\\n    8-bin target 分布但 logits masking 只保留 effective_max_dt 个 bin，cross-entropy 在 masked\\\\n    bin 上产生 ~3e8 loss。eval_return@125K=352（baseline 37%）。这是第三次同类 bug（exp_002 subsample/exp_003\\\\n    imagination dt + λ-return/exp_004 gate target vs masking），需要对 gate_max_dt vs effective_max_dt\\\\n    做全量代码审计后再重启。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_004_event_gated_v3\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: negative - gate_loss explosion 2.84e8, return 37% baseline\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: negative - same bug class\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: failed - same bug class\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: Hard Gumbel gate 结构性失败确认，启动 exp_006 fixed dt=2 诊断实验\\\\n  rationale: exp_003/004/005 三次实验均在 gate_scale>0.5 时发生 return 崩塌。exp_005 是首次在所有 bug\\\\n    修复 + gate_loss 正常(0.53) + gate 行为健康(entropy 1.54, dt_mean 2.44)条件下的崩塌，排除了实现 bug\\\\n    的可能。结论：hard Gumbel gate + variable-rate imagination 与 actor-critic 优化存在结构性冲突。exp_006\\\\n    fixed dt=2 是关键分叉诊断——如果 fixed dt=2 正常则问题在 learned gate 动态选择，如果也崩则问题在 variable-rate\\\\n    imagination 本身。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: return 崩塌 276→25.7 at gate_scale 0.5→0.6\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_004_event_gated_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - 崩塌模式相同\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_003_event_gated_v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative - 崩塌模式相同\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: 已审批待启动\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 21:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: Pivot 决策树调整：exp_006 正常分支下，K=2 binary hard gate 优先于 soft weighted gate\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出两点：(1) A1 soft weighted gate 每步需 K 次 RSSM forward pass，K=8\\\\n    时 8 倍计算开销，与时间抽象节省计算的初衷矛盾；(2) 遗漏了最简诊断方案——K=2 binary hard gate (dt∈{1,2})，保持 hard\\\\n    gate 计算效率，仅缩小离散空间和梯度方差。这能区分\\\\\\\"hard gate 本身有问题\\\\\\\"还是\\\\\\\"只是 K 太大\\\\\\\"。工程量极低（改 gate_max_dt=2）。新决策树：exp_006\\\\n    正常 → 先试 K=2 binary hard gate → 若成功则增量扩 K → 若仍失败再考虑 soft 方案。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: return collapsed to 47.4\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 22:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 修正 D010 pivot 方案：K=2 实现应用 Bernoulli straight-through 或 sigmoid relaxation，而非\\\\n    K=2 Gumbel-Softmax\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 K=2 Gumbel-Softmax 本质仍是 hard categorical gate（与 exp_003-005\\\\n    失败机制相同，只是方差更小），与 memory.md \\\\\\\"不要再尝试 hard categorical gate\\\\\\\" 矛盾。真正的 binary gate 应使用不同梯度估计器：(a)\\\\n    Bernoulli straight-through estimator（离散但梯度路径不同）或 (b) continuous sigmoid relaxation（连续化，彻底避免离散决策）。等\\\\n    exp_006/007 诊断结果出后，若走\\\\\\\"gate 是问题\\\\\\\"分支，优先尝试 Bernoulli ST，次选 sigmoid soft gate。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 三档 claim 结构确认 + 单 GPU 多实验并行策略 + exp_006 叙事修正\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 深度分析修正了两个关键判断：(1) exp_006@45K 回到 93% baseline，\\\\\\\"超基线 25%\\\\\\\" 是 35K\\\\n    处 baseline 临时回调造成的假象，正确表述是\\\\\\\"跟踪基线 ±10%\\\\\\\"——仍是正向信号（证明 dt=2 不伤害训练），但 claim 不能说\\\\\\\"超越\\\\\\\"。(2)\\\\n    三档 claim 结构：A 档（仅诊断发现，workshop 级）、B 档（Bernoulli ST 成功=方法贡献，CoRL 可投）、C 档（learned\\\\n    gate > fixed dt=最强 CoRL 投稿）。当前距 B 档缺 Bernoulli ST 实验，距 C 档缺 Bernoulli ST + learned>fixed\\\\n    两步。Bernoulli ST 是最高优先级实验。另外 Reviewer 发现 GPU 仅占 4GB/96GB，单 GPU 可并行 3-4 个实验，吞吐量可提升\\\\n    3-4×，对赶 CoRL DDL 意义重大。所有实验当前 seed=1，CoRL 最低要求 3 seeds。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 35K=485.3(125% baseline), 45K=477.0(93% baseline), tracking baseline ±10%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n    result: 35K=126.7(33% baseline), declining trend\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: Gumbel gate structural failure confirmed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: dt=4 失败根因定位：actor-critic credit assignment 崩塌，非 RSSM 预测能力不足\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立分析 3-way metrics 发现：(1) exp_007 model_loss 与 baseline/dt=2\\\\n    相当（4.75 vs 4.12 vs 5.23@35K），排除 RSSM 预测能力瓶颈假说；(2) actor_loss@35K 从正常的 -0.577(baseline)/-0.331(dt=2)\\\\n    崩塌到 -0.015(dt=4)，actor 完全停止学习；(3) actor_entropy 从 -2.42@25K 跳到 +1.54@35K，策略退化为随机；(4)\\\\n    value_mean 仅 25.9（baseline 207.8 的 12.5%），critic 严重低估。因果链明确：dt=4 粗粒度 lambda-return\\\\n    → credit assignment 困难 → critic 崩 → actor 失去信号 → 策略崩溃。这个发现对论文有三重价值：(a) 否定了简单的\\\\\\\"模型能力不足\\\\\\\"解释，将问题精确定位在\\\\n    imagination-to-policy interface；(b) 为 dt∈{1,2} sweet spot 提供因果解释而非仅经验观察；(c) 强化\\\\n    Bernoulli ST gate (dt∈{1,2}) 的设计动机。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: actor_loss→0, entropy→random, value 12.5% baseline @35K, model_loss normal\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: actor_loss=-0.331, healthy training @35K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: actor_loss=-0.577, reference @35K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_006 55K 跌至 58% baseline，诊断结论更新为\\\\\\\"最优 dt 随训练阶段变化\\\\\\\"；批准 exp_008 Bernoulli\\\\n    ST 立即启动\\\\n  rationale: exp_006 (fixed dt=2) 完整轨迹显示早期加速（15K-35K 超 baseline 67%）但后期衰退（55K 跌至 58%\\\\n    baseline），不符合原假设的场景 A（稳定）也非场景 B（全程有害）。Agent 提出场景 C：最优 dt 是训练阶段的函数——早期 dt=2 加速探索，后期需要细粒度控制。这比\\\\n    A/B 更强地论证了 learned adaptive gate 的必要性。但目前仅单 seed 数据，不能完全排除噪声/过拟合等替代解释。无论如何 Bernoulli\\\\n    ST (dt∈{1,2}) 是下一步必做实验：如果 gate 学会\\\\\\\"早期多 skip 晚期少 skip\\\\\\\"且 return ≥80% baseline，直接验证\\\\n    Scenario C + 达到 B 档 claim。cuda:1 空闲 >3h，立即批准 exp_008。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 早期+67% baseline, 55K跌至58%, 训练阶段依赖性\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: evidence_negative\\\\n    result: 全程~30% baseline, 已关闭\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008_bernoulli_st\\\\n    role: approved\\\\n    result: 待启动 cuda:1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_006 65K 崩塌至 21.6% baseline，所有 dt>1 变体均失败；疑似 subsample curriculum 分布偏移是共同根因，设计无\\\\n    curriculum 对照实验\\\\n  rationale: exp_006 (fixed dt=2) 从 35K=485.3 崩至 65K=132.9 (21.6% baseline)，推翻了\\\\\\\"fixed\\\\n    dt 没问题、问题在 gate\\\\\\\"的诊断假设。Reviewer 指出关键洞察：崩塌窗口 35K-65K 与 subsample_variable_dt curriculum\\\\n    ramp (25K→75K) 精确重叠。即使 fixed_dt 模式，subsample 仍受 curriculum 控制——0-25K 训练数据纯 dt=1\\\\n    但 imagination 用 dt=2，25K-75K 分布剧变。这与 exp_002 的 Phase 1 mismatch 失败模式高度一致。所有 4\\\\n    个 dt>1 实验（exp_003-007）的崩塌都可能由同一根因解释：train/imagine 分布不匹配被 curriculum 延迟暴露。在排除 curriculum\\\\n    混淆因素前，讨论 gate 类型无意义。暂缓 Bernoulli ST (exp_008)，先做无 curriculum 对照：fixed dt=2 + subsample\\\\n    从头用 dt∈{1,2}（无 ramp）+ dt=2 imagination，消除分布偏移。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 65K=132.9 (21.6% baseline), collapsed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_event_gated_v4\\\\n    role: pattern\\\\n    result: similar collapse window 55K-85K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_event_gated\\\\n    role: pattern\\\\n    result: Phase 1 subsample mismatch, same root cause class\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: D015 curriculum 假设被代码审查推翻；exp_009 改为纯 dt=2 训练+想象（消除 train/imagine 分布偏移），并行分析\\\\n    exp_006 崩塌机制\\\\n  rationale: Agent 代码审查（commit 6159e46）确认：fixed_dt 模式下 curriculum 完全不生效，subsample\\\\n    从 step 0 就用 dt∈{1,2}（58.5%/41.5%），imagination 纯 dt=2。D015/Reviewer 的 curriculum-induced\\\\n    distribution shift 假设不成立。实际分布偏移是常量性的：训练 58.5% dt=1 + 41.5% dt=2，imagination 100%\\\\n    dt=2。exp_009 改为方案 A：subsample min_dt=2（纯 dt=2 训练），imagination dt=2，消除 train/imagine\\\\n    分布偏移。如果稳定→train/imagine 不匹配是根因→所有实验需要匹配训练分布；如果也崩→dt=2 imagination 在 DreamerV3\\\\n    中根本不可行。同时并行分析 exp_006 的 reward/value/policy/actor_loss 详细指标定位崩塌机制。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 65K=132.9, collapsed, curriculum NOT the cause\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009_no_curriculum\\\\n    role: redesigned\\\\n    result: 改为纯 dt=2 train+imagine 对照\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: Reviewer 代码审计证实 curriculum 在 fixed_dt 模式完全不执行；采用 2x2 析因隔离实验设计（exp_008a/008b）替代\\\\n    D016 方案，kill exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n  rationale: '代码 models.py:202-206 显示 gate_fixed_dt>0 时 gate_scale=0.0、effective_max_dt\\\\n    从 step 0 即为固定值，curriculum 完全不参与。D016 基于 curriculum 推翻后的初步分析，Reviewer 代码审计给出更精确的三假说（A:\\\\n    dt=2 imagination lambda-return 偏差 / B: subsample_variable_dt 干扰 / C: dt_embedding\\\\n    质量）和更优隔离设计。2x2 析因：exp_008a(no subsample + dt=2 imag) vs exp_008b(subsample + dt=1\\\\n    imag) 可在 2 GPU 并行 1 轮实验内完全区分根因。exp_006_fixed_dt2 已 132.9@65K (21.6% baseline)\\\\n    确认 negative，继续运行浪费 GPU。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: predecessor\\\\n    result: negative (132.9@65K, 21.6% baseline)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 'isolation: no subsample + dt=2 imagination'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008b\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 'isolation: subsample + dt=1 imagination'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_008b 替换为 exp_008c (dt=2, H=8)：隔离 compounding error 假说\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立分析指出：崩塌速度与 dt 完美正相关（dt=4@35K, dt=2@65K, dt=1 不崩），根因可能是 imagination\\\\n    物理时间覆盖过长（H×dt）导致 compounding error，而非 train/imagine 分布不匹配。原 exp_008b（subsample\\\\n    ON + dt=1 imagine）诊断价值低——dt=1 imagination 安全是 trivially true。替换为 exp_008c（dt=2\\\\n    imagine + H=8，物理覆盖≈16步≈baseline 的 15 步）能直接区分\\\\\\\"dt=2 本身有害\\\\\\\"vs\\\\\\\"物理覆盖过长有害\\\\\\\"。若 008a 崩+008c\\\\n    不崩→compounding error 是根因，解法是 H∝1/dt；若都崩→dt=2 RSSM 预测质量本身不足。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: 控制组\\\\n    result: 准备中\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c\\\\n    role: 替换 exp_008b\\\\n    result: 准备中\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: 崩塌分析来源\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_007_fixed_dt4\\\\n    role: 崩塌速度对比\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: Compounding error 假说被 exp_008c 数据反驳；Narrative B（Diagnostic Analysis）确认为最强路径\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 用 eval_return 数据纠正了我对 008c 的误读。核心矛盾：compounding error 假说预测 H=8\\\\n    应优于 H=15（更短 horizon = 更少误差累积），但 eval 数据显示 008c(H=8)@35K=185.1 远劣于 008a(H=15)@35K=500.8。根因是\\\\n    learning signal reduction：H=8 只提供 7 个 imagination step 的梯度信号，lambda-return 积累更少（target=41.2\\\\n    vs 81.5@35K）。此外 008a@35K=500.8 与 exp_006@35K=485.3 惊人相似——exp_006 后续崩塌至 133@65K。dt_embedding\\\\n    混淆未消除（两个实验的 dt_embedding[1] 均未训练），008d 是唯一能消除此混淆的实验。三条 Narrative 排序：B（诊断分析）★★★★\\\\n    > C（诊断+fix 混合）★★★ > A（自适应 horizon 方法论）★★。B 利用全部 11 个实验的失败模式作为诊断证据，任何 008 结果都加分；A\\\\n    的核心 claim 被当前数据反驳。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: 反驳 compounding error 假说\\\\n    result: H=8 eval 远劣于 H=15，与假说预测相反\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: 参照组\\\\n    result: '@35K=500.8 但轨迹类似 exp_006 崩塌前'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: 消除 dt_embedding 混淆\\\\n    result: 仅到 15K，待完成\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: 崩塌参照\\\\n    result: '@35K=485.3 后崩塌至 133@65K'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: 因果机制修正：exp_006 崩塌根因是 \\\\\\\"精确 imagination → delusional critic\\\\\\\"，非 \\\\\\\"subsample\\\\n    有毒\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 通过 value/eval 比率分析发现：exp_006 的 value/eval 以 20pp/10K 速度逼近并突破\\\\n    100%（45K=53.3%, 55K=93.3%, 65K=272%），而 008a 仅 23.4%@45K。两者差异核心是 dt_embedding 是否训练——训练后\\\\n    RSSM 精确预测 dt=2 → imagination 产生高 return → value 快速追上 → advantage 枯竭 → 崩塌。未训练的\\\\n    dt_embedding 意外充当悲观 imagination 偏置，阻止 value 过估。这改变了 BernoulliST 设计方向：需要引入 value\\\\n    pessimism 机制或利用 untrained embedding 作为内置悲观偏置。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006\\\\n    role: evidence_崩塌案例\\\\n    result: peak@35K=485.3 then collapse to 132.9@65K, value/eval突破272%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a\\\\n    role: evidence_对照组\\\\n    result: '@45K=563.4仍上升, value/eval仅23.4%, 未训练dt_embedding充当悲观偏置'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c\\\\n    role: evidence_H不足\\\\n    result: H=8 learning signal不足, 非compounding error\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: Delusional critic 因果链闭合：008c vs 008d controlled experiment 直接证明 trained\\\\n    dt_embedding 是 value 过估根因\\\\n  rationale: '008d (subsample ON=dt_emb trained, H=8) @35K: eval=146.3, value/eval=41.2%。008c\\\\n    (subsample OFF=dt_emb untrained, H=8) @35K: eval=185.1, value/eval~19%。同 H 同 dt\\\\n    唯一差异是 dt_emb 训练状态，value 过估翻倍以上。008d@35K 的 41.2% 与 exp_006@35K 的 ~43% 几乎相同，证明无论\\\\n    H=8/H=15，trained dt_emb 在 35K 就产生同等程度 value 过估。因果链：trained dt_emb → RSSM 精确预测\\\\n    dt=2 → optimistic imagination → value overestimation → advantage exhaustion →\\\\n    collapse。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: direct_evidence\\\\n    result: eval=146.3@35K, value/eval=41.2%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: eval=185.1@35K, value/eval~19%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: corroboration\\\\n    result: value/eval~43%@35K, collapse@65K\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:08 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008a@55K=488 确认 no-subsample 阻止 exp_006 崩塌模式；停止已 plateau 的 008c，释放 cuda:1\\\\n    给 008e\\\\n  rationale: 008a@55K=488 vs exp_006@55K=360（+35.4%），value/eval=37.6% 远低于 006 的 53.3%。no-subsample（untrained\\\\n    dt_emb）显著延迟崩塌。008c@55K=242 已 plateau，结论明确（underfitting，非崩塌），无新信息可获取。释放 cuda:1\\\\n    给 008e 做 dt_embedding 训练 vs 使用的因果分离实验，填满 GPU 等待 008a@65K 和 008d@45K 最终确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: '@55K=488, v/e=37.6%, stable vs 006 collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: control\\\\n    result: '@55K=242, plateau confirmed, stopping'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: '@55K=360, collapsed from 485@35K'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 接受 Reviewer critical：C2 confound 需 dt_embed_dim=0 实验消除；当前 008e 测的是 imagination\\\\n    问题而非 dt_embedding 因果归因\\\\n  rationale: 008c vs 008d 同时改变了两件事：(1) dt_embedding 是否被训练 (2) RSSM 训练数据是否包含 dt=2 转移。两者不可分离。当前\\\\n    008e (subsample ON + dt=1 imagination) 测的是 imagination 使用端的因果链，而非 dt_embedding\\\\n    本身。需要 dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON 实验：如果仍崩 → 根因是 RSSM 学到 dt=2 dynamics；如果不崩 →\\\\n    dt_embedding 确实是关键。此实验对 C2 是 blocking dependency。另外 Reviewer 指出 008c v/e@65K=32.8%\\\\n    仍在上升，需标注 step 并修正 C2 证据表。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: v/e@35K=19% → @55K=29.1% → @65K=32.8%, 稳步上升\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: v/e@35K=41.2%, trained dt_emb\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: 测 imagination 使用端，非 dt_embedding 因果归因\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:17 UTC\\\\n  summary: 接受 Reviewer C2 confound 诊断：008e 重新配置为 subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0 + dt=2\\\\n    imag + H=8，直接对照 008d 消除混淆变量\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 正确指出 008c vs 008d 同时改变了 (1) dt_embedding 训练和 (2) RSSM 训练数据。当前\\\\n    008e 用 dt=1 imagination 不能对照 008d（dt=2 imag）。需要：subsample ON + dt_embed_dim=0\\\\n    + dt=2 imag + H=8，与 008d 唯一差异为 dt_embedding 有无。若此配置不崩 → dt_embedding 是根因；若崩 →\\\\n    RSSM 学 dt=2 dynamics 本身就导致问题。008e 升级为 MVP-blocking（C2 是核心 claim）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: comparison target\\\\n    result: '@35K eval=146, v/e=41.2%, collapse'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008c_no_subsample_dt2_h8\\\\n    role: original control\\\\n    result: '@55K eval=242, v/e=29-33%, plateau'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008d@45K v/e=69.3% 崩塌确认；kill 008d 释放 cuda:0 给 008f confound control\\\\n  rationale: 008d v/e 轨迹 15.5%→41.2%→69.3%（每10K +25-28pp）完美复现 006 崩塌模式，trained dt_emb\\\\n    → delusional critic 因果链进一步闭合。继续跑无额外信息增益。cuda:0 释放后立即提交 008f（dt_embed_dim=0 confound\\\\n    control），这是 complete_mvp 的最后一个阻塞项。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: v/e=69.3%@45K, collapse confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f\\\\n    role: next\\\\n    result: 'planned: dt_embed_dim=0 confound control'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: 008d@45K 崩塌确认（v/e=69.3%），kill 008d 释放 cuda:0 给 008f confound control\\\\n  rationale: '008d v/e 轨迹 15.5%→41.2%→69.3% 完美复现 006 崩塌模式（006: 31%→53%→93%），trained\\\\n    dt_emb 在 H=8 下 v/e 上升更快。继续跑无额外信息增益。释放算力给 008f（dt_embed_dim=0 confound control）是\\\\n    MVP 最后关键实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: confirmed_collapse\\\\n    result: v/e=69.3%@45K, eval declining 167→146→141\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_fixed_dt2\\\\n    role: reference_collapse\\\\n    result: v/e=31%→53%→93%→collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f\\\\n    role: next_experiment\\\\n    result: confound control dt_embed_dim=0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: C3 措辞决定：采用 \\\\\\\"preventing optimistic drift\\\\\\\" 而非 \\\\\\\"pessimistic bias\\\\\\\"；v/e 诊断重新定义为相对\\\\n    baseline 的超额比率\\\\n  rationale: Baseline v/e 稳态达 69-72%，说明高 v/e 本身不是病态——baseline 在 v/e=70% 时 eval=950\\\\n    是健康的。病态的是 v/e 远超同期 baseline（008d@45K=69% vs baseline@45K=33%，2.1x），同时 eval 停滞/下降。008a\\\\n    v/e=37% 低于 baseline@65K=56%（0.66x），确实有抑制效应，但核心机制不是\\\\\\\"值太低\\\\\\\"而是\\\\\\\"阻止了超额增长\\\\\\\"。措辞采用 Agent\\\\n    综合方案：untrained dt_emb prevents value overestimation drift, keeping v/e at or below\\\\n    baseline levels。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_baseline\\\\n    role: calibration\\\\n    result: 'v/e: 8.7%→24%→33%→40%→56%→72% steady state'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: protected\\\\n    result: v/e stable 37%, 0.66x baseline@65K\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: pathological\\\\n    result: v/e 2.1x baseline@45K, collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2 因果归因确认：dt_embedding conditioning 是 delusional critic 的直接原因。MVP 所有条件满足，准备\\\\n    complete_mvp\\\\n  rationale: 008f（dt_embed_dim=0）vs 008d（dt_embed_dim=32）唯一区别是 dt_embedding，其余完全相同（subsample\\\\n    ON, dt=2, H=8）。008f@35K normalized v/e=0.73x（正常）vs 008d@35K=1.71x（病态）。去掉 dt_embedding\\\\n    后 delusional critic 完全消失，eval 反而上升（+18%@25K, +41%@35K）。加上 008e_v3@45K normalized\\\\n    v/e=0.88x（subsample ON + untrained dt_emb 也正常），排除了 subsample 数据本身导致崩塌的可能。因果链完全闭合：trained\\\\n    dt_embedding → value overestimation drift → actor collapse。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: causal_confirmation\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 0.73x@35K, eval rising\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: causal_contrast\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 1.71x@35K, eval declining, collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3\\\\n    role: confound_control\\\\n    result: normalized v/e 0.88x@45K, subsample ON but untrained dt_emb → no collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008a_no_subsample_dt2\\\\n    role: long_term_confirmation\\\\n    result: 105K=778, normalized v/e 0.59x, structural suppression\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream审稿后战略调整：3 seeds不扩5、frame 008e_v3为mitigation、缩窄scope到RSSM/DreamerV3、加Cartpole环境+1个mitigation\\\\n    pilot\\\\n  rationale: Dream worst-case 3/6 Weak Reject，核心问题：scope-claim失配、无mitigation、seeds不足。(1)\\\\n    Seeds：效应量巨大(v/e 69% vs 19.5%)，3 seeds定性一致即可投稿，5 seeds留rebuttal；(2) 008e_v3(dt=1\\\\n    imagination, 95% baseline)本身就是practical mitigation，补1个pilot(uncertainty-gated\\\\n    truncation)；(3) 标题缩窄到RSSM/DreamerV3，讨论泛化性；(4) 加Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion第4环境，训练快、拓宽scope。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: mitigation_evidence\\\\n    result: 95% baseline, nve=0.80x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: C2_causal_confirmed\\\\n    result: nve=0.30x, V-recovery to 503\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: C2_collapse_confirmed\\\\n    result: nve=2.09x@45K, collapse\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2因果链降级：009c(seed 2)显示dt_embed_dim=0可能只延迟而非消除delusional critic，normalized\\\\n    v/e加速至1.14x@105K\\\\n  rationale: 008f seed 0恢复到503@105K(nve=0.30x)，但009c seed 2下跌至148@105K(nve=1.14x且加速中)。单seed结论不可靠。C2从\\\\\\\"eliminates\\\\\\\"降级为\\\\\\\"delays\\\\n    onset and reduces severity\\\\\\\"。需延长009c到200K观察是否越过1.5x，并等009f(seed 1)结果判断seed分布。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_0_recovery\\\\n    result: 503@105K, nve=0.30x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_divergence\\\\n    result: 148@105K, nve=1.14x accelerating\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 14:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 选 Option A narrative（机制+陷阱+正确修复），C6(008e_v3)升为crown jewel，新增plan_014(008e_v3\\\\n    seeds 1-2) P0\\\\n  rationale: 009c negative 重新审视后，C2机制识别依然成立（两个seed都无delusional critic），008f问题在于reward退化导致seed-dependent\\\\n    performance。Option A把negative变成故事深度：诊断→显然的修复有陷阱→正确修复(008e_v3)。008e_v3多seed验证成为最关键gap。Cheetah/Cartpole\\\\n    008f复现降优先级。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: triggered_reframe\\\\n    result: 148@105K, nve=1.14x, no delusional critic but reward degradation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: crown_jewel_candidate\\\\n    result: 870@105K, 95% baseline, nve=0.80x\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2再修订：trained dt_emb → pathological v/e (>1.5x) 是 robust 的(2/2)，但 collapse\\\\n    是 stochastic 的(1/2)。去掉 dt_emb → 0/2 越过 1.5x。1.5x 阈值有完美分离力。\\\\n  rationale: 009b(008d seed 2)未复现 catastrophic collapse，但@45K nve=1.62x 确实越过 1.5x\\\\n    阈值后自我修正到 0.38x@105K。统计：WITH dt_emb 2/2 seeds 越过 1.5x（008d 2.09x, 009b 1.62x），WITHOUT\\\\n    dt_emb 0/2 seeds 越过 1.5x（008f seed 0 max 1.02x, seed 2 max 1.14x）。1.5x 阈值作为诊断标记有完美分离。C2\\\\n    从 \\\\\\\"causes collapse\\\\\\\" 精确为 \\\\\\\"reliably triggers pathological v/e dynamics; catastrophic\\\\n    collapse is stochastic but high-risk\\\\\\\"。这实际上比原始 claim 更精确更可防御。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009b_008d_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_no_collapse_but_pathological\\\\n    result: nve=1.62x@45K→0.38x@105K, eval=268\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_1_catastrophic_collapse\\\\n    result: nve=2.09x@45K, eval declining\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008f_no_dt_embed_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: seed_0_no_pathological\\\\n    result: max nve=1.02x\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_009c_008f_walker_s2\\\\n    role: seed_2_no_pathological\\\\n    result: max nve=1.14x\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:44 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D033: 008e_v3 dt_embedding 实际是 trained — C6 保护机制修正为 imagination dt=1（非\\\\n    embedding 训练状态）'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 代码审计发现 008e_v3 使用 subsample=ON (--gate_subsample_max_dt 2)，dt=1/dt=2\\\\n    transitions 都流经 RSSM，nn.Embedding 默认 trainable 且无 freeze/detach，因此 dt_embedding\\\\n    是 trained。此前标注 \\\\\\\"untrained\\\\\\\" 是错误的。修正后 C6 反而更强：008d (trained dt_emb + dt>1 imag →\\\\n    collapse) vs 008e_v3 (trained dt_emb + dt=1 imag → 95% baseline)，说明关键保护变量是 imagination\\\\n    dt=1，不是 embedding 训练状态。narrative 更干净：不需要改模型架构，只需改 imagination 策略。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008e_v3_subsample_on_dt1_h15\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success, 95% baseline with trained dt_emb + dt=1 imagination\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_008d_subsample_on_h8\\\\n    role: contrast\\\\n    result: collapse with trained dt_emb + dt>1 imagination\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D032\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 27099, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01ThN6WpRhxnFZ4u1h4UFPY2","session_id":"31787645-5970-4613-84a7-699e9017e33d","uuid":"5acebf68-7f26-4b73-90a0-887888edbf29","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:50:57.062Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S7imfw1fmK5niTfvGpUsou","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。论文以\"DreamerV3中temporal abstraction失败的完整诊断\"为核心，claims覆盖：\n2\t  (1) 机制识别——trained dt_emb通过RSSM fidelity gap导致系统性value overestimation，因果链闭合； (2)\n3\t  定量诊断标记——nve>1.5x在Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole三环境×多seed中达到100%分类准确率（18/18）； (3) 跨环境验证——2个非Walker环境独立复现机制，collapse概率稳定在0.30-0.65区间；\n4\t  (4) 零成本缓解方案——C6（dt=1 imagination）在Walker 3-seed IQM=95% baseline，CI远离80%线， 从mitigation\n5\t  guideline升级为validated recommendation。 Discussion可cautiously扩展至其他latent-dynamics架构。CoRL审稿预期strong\n6\t  accept，R1和R6彻底解决。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: Walker Walk baseline seeds 1-2\n11\t  plan_id: plan_010\n12\t  description: 2 additional seeds for baseline v/e calibration\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    seed1_009d_eval_500K: 948\n15\t    seed1_009d_ve_105K: 0.66\n16\t    seed1_009d_ve_stable: 0.7\n17\t    seed2_009a_eval_500K: 942\n18\t    seed2_009a_ve_105K: 0.64\n19\t    seed2_009a_ve_stable: 0.69\n20\t    three_seed_IQM_500K: 947\n21\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n22\t    - 935\n23\t    - 959\n24\t    three_seed_baseline_105K_IQM: 918\n25\t  result_rationale: 'Walker Walk在DreamerV3中收敛快且稳定，seed 0已达950.9。009a@336K=919已确认收敛趋势，\n26\t    500K时将稳定在940-950区间。DreamerV3的dt=1 actor-critic在Walker上高度可重复， seed间方差受限于初始化和replay\n27\t    buffer采样的固有随机性（±1-2%）。v/e在135K+稳定在 69-72%是discount factor + bootstrapping的固有性质。三seed一致的CI宽度~24\n28\t    为后续所有normalized v/e计算提供坚实参照基线。\n29\t\n30\t    '\n31\t  tables:\n32\t  - title: Walker Walk baseline 3-seed summary\n33\t    data:\n34\t    - seed: 0\n35\t      eval_500K: 950.9\n36\t      ve_105K: 0.656\n37\t      ve_stable: 0.69-0.72\n38\t    - seed: 1\n39\t      eval_500K: 948\n40\t      ve_105K: 0.66\n41\t      ve_stable: ~0.70\n42\t    - seed: 2\n43\t      eval_500K: 942\n44\t      ve_105K: 0.64\n45\t      ve_stable: ~0.69\n46\t    - aggregate: IQM=947, CI_95=[935,959]\n47\t  figures_description:\n48\t  - 'Figure 1 baseline band: 三seed eval learning curve overlay + IQM shaded CI，展示baseline稳定性'\n49\t  - 'Figure 2 v/e calibration: 三seed v/e ratio随step演变，标注稳定区间69-72%'\n50\t  analysis: '三seed baseline一致性（CI宽度~24）为后续所有normalized v/e和vs_baseline%计算提供可靠参照。 CI不含900以下，Walker\n51\t    baseline鲁棒性确认。\n52\t\n53\t    '\n54\t- name: Walker Walk 008d (trained dt_emb, collapse) seeds 1-2\n55\t  plan_id: plan_011\n56\t  description: Replicate delusional critic collapse with 2 more seeds\n57\t  expected_results:\n58\t    seed1_009e_eval_trajectory:\n59\t    - 31\n60\t    - 152\n61\t    - 160\n62\t    - 135\n63\t    - 118\n64\t    - 72\n65\t    seed1_009e_nve_35K: 1.78\n66\t    seed1_009e_nve_45K: 2.25\n67\t    seed1_009e_nve_55K: 3.85\n68\t    seed1_009e_collapse: true\n69\t    seed1_009e_collapse_onset_step: 35K\n70\t    seed2_009b_status: DONE\n71\t    seed2_009b_eval_105K: 267.93\n72\t    seed2_009b_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.62x@45K (transient)\n73\t    seed2_009b_collapse: false\n74\t    three_seed_nve_above_1_5x_at_35Kplus: 3/3\n75\t    three_seed_collapse_count: 2/3\n76\t    collapse_probability: 0.67\n77\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM reward gap 2.78x确保trained dt_emb在所有seed中产生系统性value overestimation。\n78\t    seed 0 (008d)已验证sustained nve>1.5x across 3连续checkpoints→collapse；seed 2 (009b)\n79\t    已验证transient nve>1.5x→self-correction。best档下seed 1 (009e)复现seed 0的sustained pattern：early\n80\t    training stochasticity使overestimation feedback loop在35K前锁定， nve持续加速（1.78x→2.25x→3.85x），actor被误导的policy\n81\t    gradients不可逆转。 collapse概率2/3反映bifurcation的stochastic nature（consistent with Henderson\n82\t    et al. 2018）， 而3/3 exceed 1.5x证明诊断标记的perfect sensitivity。\n83\t\n84\t    '\n85\t  tables:\n86\t  - title: Walker trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n87\t    data:\n88\t    - seed: 0\n89\t      exp: 008d\n90\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 2.09x@45K sustained\n91\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 3 consecutive\n92\t      collapse: 'YES'\n93\t      eval_final: 83@55K\n94\t    - seed: 1\n95\t      exp: 009e\n96\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 2.25x@45K sustained\n97\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 3 consecutive\n98\t      collapse: 'YES'\n99\t      eval_final: 72@55K\n100\t    - seed: 2\n101\t      exp: 009b\n102\t      nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.62x@45K transient\n103\t      sustained_above_1_5x: 1 only\n104\t      collapse: 'NO'\n105\t      eval_final: 268@105K\n106\t  figures_description:\n107\t  - 'Figure 6扩展: 三seed nve trajectory overlay + 1.5x threshold line，sustained vs transient区间标注'\n108\t  - 'Collapse bifurcation diagram: sustained nve>1.5x path vs self-correction path'\n109\t  analysis: '3/3 exceed nve>1.5x（perfect sensitivity）、2/3 collapse（stochastic consequence）。\n110\t    核心论述成立：trained dt_emb是nve>1.5x的reliable trigger（100%），collapse是stochastic but\n111\t    real risk（67%）。结合untrained seeds 0/3 exceed 1.5x，Walker separating power = 6/6。\n112\t\n113\t    '\n114\t- name: Walker Walk 008f (dt_embed_dim=0, stable) seeds 1-2\n115\t  plan_id: plan_012\n116\t  description: Replicate causal control stability with 2 more seeds\n117\t  expected_results:\n118\t    seed1_009f_eval_105K: 430\n119\t    seed1_009f_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.08\n120\t    seed1_009f_nve_105K: 0.45\n121\t    seed1_009f_collapse: false\n122\t    seed1_009f_pattern: zigzag recovery\n123\t    seed2_009c_status: DONE\n124\t    seed2_009c_eval_105K: 148\n125\t    seed2_009c_nve_105K: 1.14\n126\t    seed2_009c_200K_extension_nve: 1.28\n127\t    seed2_009c_200K_extension_eval: 195\n128\t    three_seed_nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n129\t    walker_untrained_classification: 0/3 exceed 1.5x\n130\t  result_rationale: 'dt_embed_dim=0移除critic利用dt信息的能力（reward gap仅1.01x），阻断value overestimation\n131\t    反馈回路。009f在best档下复现008f seed 0的zigzag recovery（nve peaks 1.08x then decline）， 因为没有dt_emb\n132\t    conditioning，value function缺乏系统性高估的机制基础。009c虽eval下降且 nve@105K=1.14x（上升趋势），但延伸至200K后nve仅达1.28x——overestimation增长速率比\n133\t    008d慢约7x（008c vs 008d数据），远不足以在合理训练时间内达到1.5x。 0/3 seeds exceed 1.5x维持与trained seeds的完美分离。性能方差大（148-503）是预期结果：\n134\t    reward prediction退化75x导致学习信号噪声大，但不影响因果结论。\n135\t\n136\t    '\n137\t  tables:\n138\t  - title: Walker no dt_emb (008f) 3-seed comparison\n139\t    data:\n140\t    - seed: 0\n141\t      exp: 008f\n142\t      eval_105K: 503\n143\t      nve_peak: 1.02x\n144\t      nve_105K: 0.3\n145\t      pattern: zigzag recovery\n146\t    - seed: 1\n147\t      exp: 009f\n148\t      eval_105K: 430\n149\t      nve_peak: 1.08x\n150\t      nve_105K: 0.45\n151\t      pattern: zigzag recovery\n152\t    - seed: 2\n153\t      exp: 009c\n154\t      eval_105K: 148\n155\t      nve_peak: 1.26x\n156\t      nve_105K: 1.14\n157\t      pattern: decline after 75K\n158\t  figures_description:\n159\t  - 'Figure 6对比panel: 008f三seed nve（全<1.5x）vs 008d三seed nve（全>1.5x），视觉化separating\n160\t    power'\n161\t  analysis: '因果控制方向确认：去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x。008f是因果控制实验（证明方向）， 不是推荐方案（性能方差大、reward退化严重）。推荐方案仍是008e_v3（C6）。\n162\t\n163\t    '\n164\t- name: Walker Walk 008e_v3 (mitigation) seeds 1-2\n165\t  plan_id: plan_014\n166\t  description: Multi-seed validation of C6 mitigation\n167\t  expected_results:\n168\t    seed0_eval_105K: 869.9\n169\t    seed0_nve_105K: 0.8\n170\t    seed1_eval_105K: 858\n171\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.78\n172\t    seed1_vs_baseline: 93.5%\n173\t    seed2_eval_105K: 882\n174\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.83\n175\t    seed2_vs_baseline: 96.1%\n176\t    three_seed_IQM: 870\n177\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n178\t    - 852\n179\t    - 888\n180\t    three_seed_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n181\t    CI_lower_vs_80pct_baseline: 852 >> 732 (80% of 918)\n182\t  result_rationale: '008e_v3的dt=1 imagination是deterministic选择（gate_dt_1_frac=1.0），不受training\n183\t    stochasticity影响。无论seed如何变化，imagination rollout始终使用dt=1 transition， RSSM在dt=1的高fidelity（obs_MSE\n184\t    13.49 vs dt=2的27.50）确保value estimates准确。 seed间方差仅来自actor optimization的固有随机性（±2-3%），不涉及delusional\n185\t    critic机制。 三seed一致收敛到93-96% baseline，IQM=870的CI=[852,888]远高于80%线（732）， 彻底消除R6对C6可靠性的质疑。nve稳定在0.72-0.83x（健康范围内），确认value\n186\t    estimation 正常，无optimistic drift。\n187\t\n188\t    '\n189\t  tables:\n190\t  - title: Walker C6 mitigation (008e_v3) 3-seed summary\n191\t    data:\n192\t    - seed: 0\n193\t      eval_105K: 869.9\n194\t      nve_105K: 0.8\n195\t      vs_baseline: 95.0%\n196\t    - seed: 1\n197\t      eval_105K: 858\n198\t      nve_105K: 0.78\n199\t      vs_baseline: 93.5%\n200\t    - seed: 2\n201\t      eval_105K: 882\n202\t      nve_105K: 0.83\n203\t      vs_baseline: 96.1%\n204\t    - aggregate: IQM=870, CI_95=[852,888], pct_baseline=94.8%\n205\t  figures_description:\n206\t  - 'Figure 1 hero: 008e_v3三seed learning curves叠加baseline CI band，展示一致recovery'\n207\t  - 'Bar chart: baseline IQM vs 008e_v3 IQM + CI bars，80% threshold line标注'\n208\t  analysis: 'C6从single-seed observation升级为multi-seed validated recommendation。94.8%\n209\t    baseline + tight CI使论文自信声称dt=1 imagination是practical zero-cost mitigation。 与008d（collapse）和008f（因果控制但不推荐）的三方对比完成diagnosis-to-mitigation\n210\t    narrative。\n211\t\n212\t    '\n213\t- name: Walker Walk 008a (untrained dt_emb, V-recovery) seeds 1-2\n214\t  plan_id: plan_013\n215\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression with 2 more seeds\n216\t  expected_results:\n217\t    seed1_eval_105K: 725\n218\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.62\n219\t    seed1_pattern: V-recovery with zigzag\n220\t    seed2_eval_105K: 695\n221\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.67\n222\t    seed2_pattern: V-recovery\n223\t    three_seed_IQM_105K: 733\n224\t    three_seed_vs_baseline: 80%\n225\t    nve_range_105K:\n226\t    - 0.59\n227\t    - 0.67\n228\t  result_rationale: 'untrained dt_emb的value growth suppression是structural的（seed 0在55K-105K持续nve<1.0x且\n229\t    趋势进一步diverge from baseline）。新seeds复现同样pattern：untrained embedding阻断critic 对dt信息的exploitation，value被结构性压低。V-recovery的zigzag反映actor在被压低的value\n230\t    landscape中exploration效率受限，但最终趋势向上。seed间方差（695-778）来自V-recovery timing的stochastic差异。IQM=733（80%\n231\t    baseline）优于008f但低于008e_v3，论文中定位为 \"C3 mechanism understanding\"而非推荐方案。\n232\t\n233\t    '\n234\t  tables:\n235\t  - title: Walker untrained dt_emb (008a) 3-seed summary\n236\t    data:\n237\t    - seed: 0\n238\t      eval_105K: 778\n239\t      nve_105K: 0.59\n240\t      pattern: two V-recoveries\n241\t      vs_baseline: 85%\n242\t    - seed: 1\n243\t      eval_105K: 725\n244\t      nve_105K: 0.62\n245\t      pattern: V-recovery zigzag\n246\t      vs_baseline: 79%\n247\t    - seed: 2\n248\t      eval_105K: 695\n249\t      nve_105K: 0.67\n250\t      pattern: V-recovery\n251\t      vs_baseline: 76%\n252\t    - aggregate: IQM=733, vs_baseline=80%\n253\t  figures_description:\n254\t  - 'C3 figure: 008a三seed nve vs baseline band，展示structural suppression持续<1.0x'\n255\t  analysis: 'C3多seed验证。value growth suppression confirmed as structural property of\n256\t    untrained dt_emb。 与008e_v3对比（80% vs 95%）证明dt=1 imagination is superior to untrained\n257\t    dt_emb as mitigation。\n258\t\n259\t    '\n260\t- name: Cheetah Run baseline (3 seeds)\n261\t  plan_id: plan_020\n262\t  description: dt=1 baseline in second DMC environment\n263\t  expected_results:\n264\t    seed1_eval_500K: 775\n265\t    seed2_eval_500K: 790\n266\t    seed3_eval_500K: 785\n267\t    three_seed_IQM_500K: 783\n268\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n269\t    - 770\n270\t    - 796\n271\t    ve_25K: 0.1\n272\t    ve_35K: 0.23\n273\t    ve_45K: 0.31\n274\t    ve_105K: 0.58\n275\t    ve_stable: 0.62-0.67 from 200K+\n276\t    baseline_105K_IQM: 590\n277\t  result_rationale: 'Cheetah Run是DMC中与Walker难度相当的连续控制任务。DreamerV3原论文报告~800 at 1M steps，\n278\t    500K下达783符合sample efficiency预期。v/e calibration与Walker类似但收敛稍慢 （Cheetah velocity-based\n279\t    reward结构使value estimation需要更多training data）， asymptotic v/e略低（0.62-0.67 vs Walker\n280\t    0.69-0.72）反映reward scale和episode horizon差异。 三seed一致性高因为Cheetah dynamics相对光滑。baseline_105K_IQM=590为Cheetah\n281\t    ablation提供参照。\n282\t\n283\t    '\n284\t  tables:\n285\t  - title: Cheetah Run baseline 3-seed v/e calibration\n286\t    data:\n287\t    - step: 25K\n288\t      ve_mean: 0.1\n289\t      ve_std: 0.02\n290\t    - step: 35K\n291\t      ve_mean: 0.23\n292\t      ve_std: 0.03\n293\t    - step: 45K\n294\t      ve_mean: 0.31\n295\t      ve_std: 0.03\n296\t    - step: 105K\n297\t      ve_mean: 0.58\n298\t      ve_std: 0.03\n299\t    - converged: IQM=783, CI=[770,796]\n300\t  figures_description:\n301\t  - 'Cross-env baseline panel: Walker vs Cheetah eval + v/e parallel comparison'\n302\t  analysis: 'Cheetah baseline确立。IQM=783和v/e calibration为该环境所有ablation提供normalized\n303\t    v/e 计算的reference。\n304\t\n305\t    '\n306\t- name: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n307\t  plan_id: plan_021\n308\t  description: Replicate delusional critic mechanism in Cheetah Run\n309\t  expected_results:\n310\t    seed1_eval_peak: 310\n311\t    seed1_eval_65K: 95\n312\t    seed1_nve_35K: 1.72\n313\t    seed1_nve_45K: 2.35\n314\t    seed1_collapse: true\n315\t    seed2_eval_105K: 245\n316\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.65x@45K\n317\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.75\n318\t    seed2_collapse: false\n319\t    seed3_eval_105K: 210\n320\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.58x@35K\n321\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.88\n322\t    seed3_collapse: false\n323\t    nve_above_1_5x_count: 3/3\n324\t    collapse_count: 1/3\n325\t    cheetah_trained_classification: 3/3 exceed 1.5x\n326\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity gap是architecture-level property（autoregressive\n327\t    prediction error compounding）， 不因环境改变。Cheetah的RSSM在dt=2上同样有显著obs/reward prediction退化，trained\n328\t    dt_emb 同样使critic exploit imprecise dt>1 predictions。3/3 seeds exceed nve>1.5x与Walker一致\n329\t    （mechanism is environment-independent）。collapse概率1/3略低于Walker的2/3，因为Cheetah velocity-based\n330\t    reward更平滑，self-correction force略强——early overestimation更容易被 environment returns纠正。但1/3\n331\t    collapse仍足以证明real risk（>30% threshold）。 seed 1的early stochasticity锁定sustained\n332\t    overestimation pattern，另两seed transient exceed后self-correct。\n333\t\n334\t    '\n335\t  tables:\n336\t  - title: Cheetah Run trained dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n337\t    data:\n338\t    - seed: 1\n339\t      eval_peak: 310\n340\t      eval_final: 95@65K\n341\t      nve_peak: 2.35x@45K\n342\t      collapse: 'YES'\n343\t    - seed: 2\n344\t      eval_peak: 280\n345\t      eval_final: 245@105K\n346\t      nve_peak: 1.65x@45K\n347\t      collapse: 'NO'\n348\t    - seed: 3\n349\t      eval_peak: 265\n350\t      eval_final: 210@105K\n351\t      nve_peak: 1.58x@35K\n352\t      collapse: 'NO'\n353\t  figures_description:\n354\t  - 'Cross-env nve comparison: Walker vs Cheetah trained dt_emb nve trajectories并排\n355\t    + 1.5x line'\n356\t  - Cheetah three-seed eval + nve dual-axis plot\n357\t  analysis: '第一个非Walker环境验证C2。3/3 exceed nve>1.5x直接回应R1（单环境concern）。 collapse概率1/3使跨环境合并概率=(2+1)/(3+3)=50%，在[0.3,0.65]内。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t- name: Cheetah Run dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n361\t  plan_id: plan_022\n362\t  description: Replicate causal control in Cheetah Run\n363\t  expected_results:\n364\t    seed1_eval_105K: 385\n365\t    seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n366\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.5\n367\t    seed2_eval_105K: 340\n368\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.18\n369\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.72\n370\t    seed3_eval_105K: 360\n371\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.12\n372\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.62\n373\t    nve_above_1_5x_count: 0/3\n374\t    cheetah_classification_accuracy: 6/6 (trained 3/3 exceed + untrained 0/3 exceed)\n375\t  result_rationale: '与Walker 008f一致：去掉dt_embedding后reward head无法区分dt=1/dt=2（reward\n376\t    gap ~1.0x）， value overestimation反馈回路被阻断。Cheetah环境不改变这一机制——RSSM prediction error\n377\t    仍存在但critic无法exploit dt信息。三seed nve peaks（1.05-1.18x）远低于1.5x threshold， 与同环境trained\n378\t    dt_emb seeds的1.58-2.35x形成clean separation。eval方差（340-385） 反映缺失dt_embedding后reward\n379\t    prediction退化的随机影响，但不影响分类结论。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t  tables:\n383\t  - title: Cheetah Run no dt_emb 3-seed comparison\n384\t    data:\n385\t    - seed: 1\n386\t      eval_105K: 385\n387\t      nve_peak: 1.05x\n388\t      nve_105K: 0.5\n389\t    - seed: 2\n390\t      eval_105K: 340\n391\t      nve_peak: 1.18x\n392\t      nve_105K: 0.72\n393\t    - seed: 3\n394\t      eval_105K: 360\n395\t      nve_peak: 1.12x\n396\t      nve_105K: 0.62\n397\t  figures_description:\n398\t  - 'Cheetah nve threshold scatter: trained seeds (>1.5x) vs untrained seeds (<1.5x)，zero\n399\t    overlap'\n400\t  analysis: 'Cheetah 6/6分类准确率。Combined Walker+Cheetah = 12/12 = 100%。 因果控制方向在第二环境独立确认。\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t- name: Cheetah Run untrained dt_emb + no subsample (3 seeds)\n404\t  plan_id: plan_023\n405\t  description: Replicate value growth suppression (C3) in Cheetah Run\n406\t  expected_results:\n407\t    seed1_eval_105K: 460\n408\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.58\n409\t    seed1_pattern: V-recovery\n410\t    seed2_eval_105K: 425\n411\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.65\n412\t    seed2_pattern: V-recovery\n413\t    seed3_eval_105K: 440\n414\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.6\n415\t    seed3_pattern: slow climb\n416\t    three_seed_IQM: 442\n417\t    vs_baseline_pct: 75%\n418\t  result_rationale: 'untrained dt_emb的value suppression机制是architecture-level的，Cheetah中同样表现为\n419\t    nve<1.0x structural suppression。Cheetah smoother reward landscape使V-recovery更稳定\n420\t    （较少zigzag），IQM=75% baseline与Walker 80%可比。no subsample保留全部training transitions，\n421\t    与plan_022（subsample ON）的对比可进一步分离subsample vs dt_emb效应（C5 support）。 三seed一致在60-75%\n422\t    baseline区间，确认value suppression的cross-env robustness。\n423\t\n424\t    '\n425\t  tables:\n426\t  - title: Cheetah untrained dt_emb 3-seed summary\n427\t    data:\n428\t    - seed: 1\n429\t      eval_105K: 460\n430\t      nve_105K: 0.58\n431\t    - seed: 2\n432\t      eval_105K: 425\n433\t      nve_105K: 0.65\n434\t    - seed: 3\n435\t      eval_105K: 440\n436\t      nve_105K: 0.6\n437\t    - aggregate: IQM=442, 75% baseline\n438\t  figures_description:\n439\t  - 'Cross-env C3: Walker 008a vs Cheetah untrained dt_emb nve suppression parallel\n440\t    panels'\n441\t  analysis: 'C3跨环境验证。value growth suppression confirmed as architecture-level property。\n442\t    论文C3 evidence表增加Cheetah行。\n443\t\n444\t    '\n445\t- name: 'RSSM prediction quality: dt=1 vs dt=2 transitions'\n446\t  plan_id: plan_030\n447\t  description: Systematic RSSM fidelity gap measurement across checkpoints and environments\n448\t  expected_results:\n449\t    walker_obs_gap_25K: 1.85\n450\t    walker_obs_gap_45K: 2.04\n451\t    walker_obs_gap_105K: 2.2\n452\t    walker_reward_gap_trained: 2.78\n453\t    walker_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.01\n454\t    cheetah_obs_gap_baseline: 2.1\n455\t    cheetah_reward_gap_trained: 2.55\n456\t    cheetah_reward_gap_no_dtEmb: 1.03\n457\t    cartpole_obs_gap_baseline: 1.95\n458\t    cartpole_reward_gap_trained: 2.4\n459\t    gap_nve_pearson_r: 0.87\n460\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM autoregressive prediction的compounding error在dt>1时是数学必然——obs\n461\t    gap ~2.0x 是两步预测误差近似翻倍的直接反映。trained dt_emb使reward head学到\"dt=2应产生不同reward\" 的pattern，但RSSM\n462\t    state质量不支持这个精度，导致reward gap amplification（2.4-2.8x）。 no dt_emb时reward gap ~1.0x因为reward\n463\t    head无法区分dt。gap与nve的高相关性（r=0.87） 为因果叙事提供定量支撑：fidelity gap越大→overestimation越严重。\n464\t    跨环境obs gap一致（1.95-2.20x）证明这是architecture property。\n465\t\n466\t    '\n467\t  tables:\n468\t  - title: Cross-environment RSSM fidelity table\n469\t    data:\n470\t    - env: Walker\n471\t      config: baseline\n472\t      obs_gap: 2.04\n473\t      reward_gap: 1.56\n474\t    - env: Walker\n475\t      config: trained dt_emb\n476\t      obs_gap: 1.3\n477\t      reward_gap: 2.78\n478\t    - env: Walker\n479\t      config: no dt_emb\n480\t      obs_gap: 2.75\n481\t      reward_gap: 1.01\n482\t    - env: Cheetah\n483\t      config: baseline\n484\t      obs_gap: 2.1\n485\t      reward_gap: 1.5\n486\t    - env: Cheetah\n487\t      config: trained dt_emb\n488\t      obs_gap: 1.35\n489\t      reward_gap: 2.55\n490\t    - env: Cheetah\n491\t      config: no dt_emb\n492\t      obs_gap: 2.8\n493\t      reward_gap: 1.03\n494\t    - env: Cartpole\n495\t      config: baseline\n496\t      obs_gap: 1.95\n497\t      reward_gap: 1.45\n498\t    - env: Cartpole\n499\t      config: trained dt_emb\n500\t      obs_gap: 1.28\n501\t      reward_gap: 2.4\n502\t  figures_description:\n503\t  - 'Table 1扩展: 跨环境RSSM fidelity，绝对误差+比率并排，highlight reward gap异常'\n504\t  - 'Scatter: reward gap vs nve peak across all experiments'\n505\t  analysis: '跨环境一致的RSSM fidelity gap pattern为C2因果链提供mechanistic foundation。 论文可在Discussion中argument：任何latent-dynamics\n506\t    model若有类似fidelity gap， 都可能面临同样问题。\n507\t\n508\t    '\n509\t- name: Actor entropy analysis\n510\t  plan_id: plan_031\n511\t  description: Actor entropy trajectories for healthy vs collapsed configs\n512\t  expected_results:\n513\t    healthy_entropy_pattern: monotonic decrease 1.4→0.6 over 105K\n514\t    collapsed_entropy_pattern: decrease to ~0.5@35K then INCREASE to ~0.9@55K\n515\t    entropy_increase_magnitude: 2-3x above healthy at same step\n516\t    divergence_onset: coincides with nve crossing 1.5x (±5K steps)\n517\t  result_rationale: '健康训练中actor entropy单调下降反映policy refinement。delusional critic错误gradients\n518\t    使actor丧失learned structure，entropy回升=policy confusion。divergence onset与nve crossing\n519\t    1.5x同步因为一旦value overestimation足够严重，actor gradient被错误的value landscape主导。这提供C2的independent\n520\t    observable（除nve外的第二个collapse早期信号）。\n521\t\n522\t    '\n523\t  tables: []\n524\t  figures_description:\n525\t  - 'Entropy divergence: healthy (008a/008c/008e_v3) vs collapsed (006/008d) entropy\n526\t    curves'\n527\t  analysis: 'Actor entropy increase与nve>1.5x的temporal coincidence提供因果链的独立证据维度。 可作为Discussion中的secondary\n528\t    diagnostic signal。\n529\t\n530\t    '\n531\t- name: Value prediction distribution vs realized returns\n532\t  plan_id: plan_032\n533\t  description: Distributional analysis of V(s) vs MC return\n534\t  expected_results:\n535\t    trained_dtEmb_distribution: heavy right tail, V(s) 1.5-3x above MC return\n536\t    untrained_dtEmb_distribution: slight left skew, V(s) ~0.8x MC return\n537\t    baseline_distribution: well-calibrated, ~10-20% overestimation\n538\t    kl_trained_vs_true: 0.45\n539\t    kl_untrained_vs_true: 0.12\n540\t    kl_baseline_vs_true: 0.08\n541\t  result_rationale: 'trained dt_emb使critic系统性高估dt>1 transitions的value，体现为V(s)分布的heavy\n542\t    right tail。 untrained dt_emb抑制这个机制，分布略左偏（value被压低）。KL divergence定量化overestimation\n543\t    程度（0.45 vs 0.08），比单一v/e ratio更informative——展示overestimation的distributional structure而非point\n544\t    estimate。直接回应R3。\n545\t\n546\t    '\n547\t  tables: []\n548\t  figures_description:\n549\t  - 'V(s) vs MC return scatter+histogram: 三配置对比，KL标注'\n550\t  analysis: '回应R3（v/e ratio粗糙proxy）。distributional evidence更rigorous。0 GPU成本，应包含在论文中。\n551\t\n552\t    '\n553\t- name: dt_embedding cosine similarity analysis\n554\t  plan_id: plan_033\n555\t  description: Learned dt embedding divergence over training\n556\t  expected_results:\n557\t    cosine_sim_5K: 0.85\n558\t    cosine_sim_25K: 0.45\n559\t    cosine_sim_45K: 0.25\n560\t    cosine_sim_105K: 0.2\n561\t    divergence_onset: 15K-25K\n562\t    norm_ratio_dt2_over_dt1_105K: 1.35\n563\t  result_rationale: 'dt_embedding初始化为random（cosine ~0.85 at 5K），world model训练中学习区分dt=1/dt=2\n564\t    dynamics差异，embedding vectors diverge。divergence onset（15K-25K）与reward gap开始 amplify的时间一致：embedding\n565\t    divergence赋予reward head区分dt的能力，进而创造系统性bias。 dt=2 norm比dt=1高1.35x反映model对dt>1的重视，但RSSM\n566\t    state质量不支持这个精度。\n567\t\n568\t    '\n569\t  tables:\n570\t  - title: dt_embedding evolution\n571\t    data:\n572\t    - step: 5K\n573\t      cosine_sim: 0.85\n574\t      norm_ratio: 1.02\n575\t    - step: 25K\n576\t      cosine_sim: 0.45\n577\t      norm_ratio: 1.2\n578\t    - step: 45K\n579\t      cosine_sim: 0.25\n580\t      norm_ratio: 1.3\n581\t    - step: 105K\n582\t      cosine_sim: 0.2\n583\t      norm_ratio: 1.35\n584\t  figures_description:\n585\t  - Embedding divergence timeline + nve onset annotation\n586\t  analysis: 'embedding-level evidence: trained dt_emb确实学到区分dt的representation， 这正是trigger\n587\t    overestimation的前提。与untrained dt_emb（cosine ~0.85 throughout）对比。\n588\t\n589\t    '\n590\t- name: Cartpole Swingup baseline (3 seeds)\n591\t  plan_id: plan_050\n592\t  description: dt=1 baseline in non-locomotion DMC environment\n593\t  expected_results:\n594\t    seed1_eval_500K: 842\n595\t    seed2_eval_500K: 850\n596\t    seed3_eval_500K: 838\n597\t    three_seed_IQM: 843\n598\t    three_seed_CI_95:\n599\t    - 835\n600\t    - 851\n601\t    ve_35K: 0.25\n602\t    ve_105K: 0.56\n603\t    ve_stable: 0.60-0.65\n604\t    baseline_105K_IQM: 720\n605\t  result_rationale: 'Cartpole Swingup作为非locomotion环境拓宽scope。DreamerV3在Cartpole上表现优异\n606\t    （原论文~860 at 1M），500K下达843合理。Cartpole dynamics相对简单（4D state）， 训练方差小（CI宽度~16）。v/e收敛略低（0.60-0.65）反映shorter\n607\t    effective episode horizon。 作为非locomotion task，其inclusion直接回应\"are results specific\n608\t    to walking tasks\"的concern。\n609\t\n610\t    '\n611\t  tables:\n612\t  - title: Cartpole baseline 3-seed\n613\t    data:\n614\t    - seed: 1\n615\t      eval_500K: 842\n616\t      ve_105K: 0.55\n617\t    - seed: 2\n618\t      eval_500K: 850\n619\t      ve_105K: 0.57\n620\t    - seed: 3\n621\t      eval_500K: 838\n622\t      ve_105K: 0.56\n623\t    - aggregate: IQM=843, CI=[835,851]\n624\t  figures_description:\n625\t  - '三环境baseline panel: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole parallel eval curves'\n626\t  analysis: '非locomotion baseline建立。三环境scope增强论文generalization claim。\n627\t\n628\t    '\n629\t- name: Cartpole Swingup trained dt_emb + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n630\t  plan_id: plan_051\n631\t  description: Replicate delusional critic in Cartpole Swingup\n632\t  expected_results:\n633\t    seed1_eval_65K: 125\n634\t    seed1_nve_45K: 2.1\n635\t    seed1_collapse: true\n636\t    seed2_eval_105K: 305\n637\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.55x@45K\n638\t    seed2_collapse: false\n639\t    seed3_eval_105K: 285\n640\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.52x@35K\n641\t    seed3_collapse: false\n642\t    nve_above_1_5x: 3/3\n643\t    collapse_count: 1/3\n644\t    cartpole_trained_classification: 3/3 exceed 1.5x\n645\t  result_rationale: 'RSSM fidelity gap是architecture property，不依赖环境复杂度。即使Cartpole dynamics更简单\n646\t    （4D vs Walker 24D），autoregressive dt>1 prediction error compounding仍存在。 trained\n647\t    dt_emb在Cartpole中同样trigger nve>1.5x：3/3 seeds exceed threshold。 collapse概率1/3与Cheetah一致——simpler\n648\t    dynamics使self-correction更有效，但overestimation 本身仍可靠出现。seed 2/3的borderline peaks（1.52-1.55x）加强1.5x\n649\t    threshold的 discriminative precision——even in easiest test environment，trained\n650\t    dt_emb reliably crosses。\n651\t\n652\t    '\n653\t  tables:\n654\t  - title: Cartpole trained dt_emb 3-seed\n655\t    data:\n656\t    - seed: 1\n657\t      nve_peak: 2.10x@45K\n658\t      collapse: 'YES'\n659\t    - seed: 2\n660\t      nve_peak: 1.55x@45K\n661\t      collapse: 'NO'\n662\t    - seed: 3\n663\t      nve_peak: 1.52x@35K\n664\t      collapse: 'NO'\n665\t  figures_description:\n666\t  - '三环境nve threshold figure: Walker/Cheetah/Cartpole trained vs untrained，1.5x line'\n667\t  analysis: '第二个非Walker环境验证。cross_env_mechanism_replication=2（Cheetah+Cartpole）满足best档。\n668\t    Cartpole 3/3 exceed 1.5x + borderline peaks证明threshold在simpler environments仍有效。\n669\t\n670\t    '\n671\t- name: Cartpole Swingup dt_embed_dim=0 + subsample ON (3 seeds)\n672\t  plan_id: plan_052\n673\t  description: Replicate causal control in Cartpole Swingup\n674\t  expected_results:\n675\t    seed1_eval_105K: 480\n676\t    seed1_nve_peak_35Kplus: 0.98\n677\t    seed1_nve_105K: 0.48\n678\t    seed2_eval_105K: 445\n679\t    seed2_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.1\n680\t    seed2_nve_105K: 0.6\n681\t    seed3_eval_105K: 460\n682\t    seed3_nve_peak_35Kplus: 1.05\n683\t    seed3_nve_105K: 0.55\n684\t    nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n685\t    cartpole_classification: 6/6\n686\t    grand_total_classification: 18/18 = 100%\n687\t  result_rationale: '去掉dt_embedding → 0/3 exceed nve>1.5x，与Walker/Cheetah完全一致。 Cartpole\n688\t    simpler dynamics使no dt_emb configs表现相对更好（eval 445-480，占baseline 62-67%），因为lower-dimensional\n689\t    state从noisy reward signal中学习更高效。 nve peaks（0.98-1.10x）远低于1.5x。Grand total classification\n690\t    = 18/18 = 100%。\n691\t\n692\t    '\n693\t  tables:\n694\t  - title: Cartpole no dt_emb 3-seed\n695\t    data:\n696\t    - seed: 1\n697\t      eval_105K: 480\n698\t      nve_peak: 0.98x\n699\t    - seed: 2\n700\t      eval_105K: 445\n701\t      nve_peak: 1.10x\n702\t    - seed: 3\n703\t      eval_105K: 460\n704\t      nve_peak: 1.05x\n705\t  figures_description:\n706\t  - 'Grand classification scatter: 三环境×2组(trained/untrained)所有18个数据点，1.5x line，zero\n707\t    overlap'\n708\t  analysis: '三环境因果控制完成。18/18 classification = 100%。nve>1.5x作为诊断标记的 cross-environment\n709\t    robustness fully established。论文可自信声称\"architecture-level diagnostic\"。\n710\t\n711\t    '\n712\t- name: Uncertainty-gated imagination truncation pilot (Walker Walk, 1 seed)\n713\t  plan_id: plan_060\n714\t  description: RSSM uncertainty-based truncation feasibility test\n715\t  expected_results:\n716\t    eval_105K: 815\n717\t    vs_baseline_pct: 89%\n718\t    vs_008e_v3_pct: 93.7%\n719\t    nve_105K: 0.75\n720\t    truncation_rate_45K: 65% of dt>1 steps truncated\n721\t    truncation_rate_105K: 40% (RSSM quality improves)\n722\t    mean_effective_dt: 1.35\n723\t    collapse: false\n724\t  result_rationale: 'uncertainty-gated truncation在imagination中监控RSSM prediction uncertainty\n725\t    （posterior/prior KL或obs reconstruction error），超threshold时truncate dt>1 steps。\n726\t    early training时RSSM质量差→aggressive truncation（65%），随质量提升truncation率降至40%。 eval=815（89%\n727\t    baseline, 94% of 008e_v3）展示feasibility——性能略低于008e_v3因为 uncertainty estimation\n728\t    noise导致部分有益dt>1 steps也被truncated。 nve=0.75x确认delusional critic被控制。关键价值：证明beyond\n729\t    \"always dt=1\"的方向可行。\n730\t\n731\t    '\n732\t  tables:\n733\t  - title: Mitigation method comparison\n734\t    data:\n735\t    - method: baseline (dt=1)\n736\t      eval: 916\n737\t      nve: 0.66\n738\t    - method: 008e_v3 (always dt=1 imag)\n739\t      eval: 870\n740\t      nve: 0.8\n741\t    - method: uncertainty-gated\n742\t      eval: 815\n743\t      nve: 0.75\n744\t    - method: 008d (no gate, collapse)\n745\t      eval: 83\n746\t      nve: 4.12x\n747\t  figures_description:\n748\t  - Pilot learning curve vs 008e_v3 vs baseline\n749\t  - 'Truncation rate over training: adaptive behavior curve'\n750\t  analysis: '达到008e_v3的94%（>90% threshold），证明uncertainty-gated approach可行。 Discussion中作为concrete\n751\t    future direction：selective dt>1 imagination as RSSM improves。\n752\t\n753\t    '\n754\t- name: Hopper Hop validation (3 seeds × 3 configs)\n755\t  plan_id: plan_040\n756\t  description: Third DMC environment (harder task) for generalization\n757\t  expected_results:\n758\t    baseline_IQM_500K: 305\n759\t    baseline_CI:\n760\t    - 280\n761\t    - 330\n762\t    baseline_ve_stable: 0.55-0.62\n763\t    trained_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: 2/3\n764\t    trained_dtEmb_collapse: 1/3\n765\t    trained_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 85\n766\t    no_dtEmb_nve_above_1_5x: 0/3\n767\t    no_dtEmb_eval_IQM_105K: 155\n768\t    hopper_classification: 5/6 (83%)\n769\t    grand_total_with_hopper: 23/24 (96%)\n770\t  result_rationale: 'Hopper Hop是较难环境（不稳定dynamics, 低baseline ~300），RSSM prediction质量本身更差。\n771\t    trained dt_emb仍trigger nve>1.5x但2/3（非3/3），因为one seed在极低baseline下 v/e ratio denominator波动大（eval\n772\t    ~50-80），诊断标记noise增加使one seed的nve peak 停在1.42x（刚below 1.5x）。classification 5/6=83%略低于其他环境100%但仍robust。\n773\t    跨四环境grand total = 23/24 = 96%进一步增强generalization。\n774\t\n775\t    '\n776\t  tables:\n777\t  - title: Hopper 3-config summary\n778\t    data:\n779\t    - config: baseline\n780\t      IQM: 305\n781\t    - config: trained dt_emb\n782\t      IQM: 85\n783\t      nve_exceed: 2/3\n784\t      collapse: 1/3\n785\t    - config: no dt_emb\n786\t      IQM: 155\n787\t      nve_exceed: 0/3\n788\t  figures_description:\n789\t  - '四环境mechanism replication grid: 2×4 (trained/untrained × 4 envs), nve peaks annotated'\n790\t  analysis: 'P2 stretch goal。Hopper inclusion使scope从3到4环境。5/6 classification + mechanism\n791\t    replication增强generalization。即使不含Hopper，Walker+Cheetah+Cartpole已足够（18/18）。\n792\t\n793\t    '\n794\t- name: Best-tier aggregate metrics\n795\t  plan_id: aggregate\n796\t  description: Cross-experiment key metrics summary\n797\t  expected_results:\n798\t    C6_recovery_pct_of_baseline: 94.8\n799\t    nve_threshold_classification_accuracy: 1.0\n800\t    cross_env_mechanism_replication: 2\n801\t    collapse_prob_trained_dt_emb: 0.44\n802\t    walker_008e_v3_IQM_pct_baseline: 94.8\n803\t    walker_nve_separating_power: 1.0\n804\t    total_remaining_GPU_hours: ~160\n805\t  result_rationale: '六项关键指标均在best档定义范围内：C6_recovery 94.8%∈[90,98]；classification 1.0∈[0.85,1.0]；\n806\t    cross_env 2∈[2,3]；collapse_prob 0.44∈[0.3,0.65]（Walker 2/3 + Cheetah 1/3 + Cartpole\n807\t    1/3 = 4/9）； IQM 94.8%∈[88,96]；separating_power 1.0∈[0.9,1.0]。narrative完整闭合： mechanism\n808\t    identification → quantitative diagnostic → cross-env validation → zero-cost mitigation\n809\t    → future direction。所有CoRL reviewer concerns（R1-R8）均有充分回应。\n810\t\n811\t    '\n812\t  tables:\n813\t  - title: Key metrics vs best-tier targets\n814\t    data:\n815\t    - metric: C6 recovery\n816\t      value: 94.8\n817\t      range: '[90,98]'\n818\t      status: ✓\n819\t    - metric: nve classification\n820\t      value: 1.0\n821\t      range: '[0.85,1.0]'\n822\t      status: ✓\n823\t    - metric: cross-env replication\n824\t      value: 2\n825\t      range: '[2,3]'\n826\t      status: ✓\n827\t    - metric: collapse probability\n828\t      value: 0.44\n829\t      range: '[0.3,0.65]'\n830\t      status: ✓\n831\t    - metric: 008e_v3 IQM %baseline\n832\t      value: 94.8\n833\t      range: '[88,96]'\n834\t      status: ✓\n835\t    - metric: nve separating power\n836\t      value: 1.0\n837\t      range: '[0.9,1.0]'\n838\t      status: ✓\n839\t  figures_description:\n840\t  - 'Summary figure: 六指标在target range中的位置'\n841\t  analysis: best档全面达成。论文framing从single-env diagnostic升级为cross-environment validated\n842\t    diagnostic framework。CoRL strong accept预期有充分数据支撑。\n843\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01L4jssAZWLAQJYMSAJSFtZm","session_id":"31787645-5970-4613-84a7-699e9017e33d","uuid":"571c8b74-5180-4f2b-9aaf-7acd1ea3e0b3","timestamp":"2026-05-15T01:50:57.334Z"}
